WEBVTT

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:23.360
Please, be seated.&nbsp;

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:40.893
So nice to see you all here. Very good.

00:00:45.942 --> 00:00:52.952
Just My idea is to have a very informal talk

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:59.200
between the Mother and the children, we can say.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:08.160
And for that, I was thinking of getting about five – six people

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:17.040
from various countries to be seated here, and who all – Hello, how are you?

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:17.920
Very good, Mother.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:18.800
Nice to see you.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:28.080
To ask questions to them. And I want to watch

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:33.280
what sort of questions you ask, what sort of answers you get.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:41.920
And of course, I’ll be able to also answer some of the questions.

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:48.340
And how to answer the questions of a person who is not yet Realized,

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:54.560
is half-baked, and how to handle the situation we have to learn,

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:58.080
that’s very important. Because you have to know

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:02.480
that negativity is in complete force all the time.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:15.040
And you have to face the negative ideas, negative people, negative plans.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:19.840
And when they plan, it is necessary – please, sit down, all of you –

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:26.720
it is necessary for all the Sahaja Yogis that they should be equipped –

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:28.339
Move forward.

00:02:28.339 --> 00:02:29.953
Come forward.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:38.240
They should be so equipped that they should be able to face…

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:46.960
sometimes it’s subtle, you see. There can be many like that you meet,

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:52.520
who are seekers, who have been seeking, who have been doing lots of mistakes

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:58.080
and who have all the conditionings, problems and it’s not easy

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:03.040
that kind of confrontation you get.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:09.600
Then also you get some funny sort of people who are in Sahaja Yoga

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:15.040
for some time and somehow, they cannot manage to get up.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:22.840
Very low-graded people I should say. And really, you get disgusted with them.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:32.240
That’s the second style of people. Because God’s work today

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:36.556
is to save as many as possible, that’s the work we have to do.

00:03:36.556 --> 00:03:43.120
But there are all kinds of mental projections and hangs-up

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:47.520
and all that. And the first thing they do to attack

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:54.800
is a question. Then there are suggestions.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:04:06.400
Then there can be actual fighting. I had such a one very recently

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:10.160
which I must tell you, the most interesting one, I think.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:14.640
That’s Peggy and you know Peggy, how she is.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:22.640
Nobody needs worry about her. The kind of a quality she is, you know,

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.520
we have told her that we don’t want her anymore.

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:30.800
In Sahaja Yoga, we do not ask people to come.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:36.480
They come to us, we don’t force them, and if they are hopelessly bad

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:40.560
then we say, “All right, we have had enough of it, now, please forgive us”.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:45.520
And they get out of Sahaja Yoga, you see, mostly, this is how we work out.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:50.160
Because we have to choose, you see, that’s what you have to do with people.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:54.880
Because there can be very high-quality people and there can be

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:58.480
very cheap type of people also.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.280
Now, Peggy everybody knows has been with us for five – six years.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:09.040
And she has been to horrible places and has a funny type of a personality,

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.080
I don’t know. If God has made her, I don’t know

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.440
how He has made her that way. Because she’s been to all kinds

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:19.760
of wrong stuff, absolutely to horrible things, filthy, dirty.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:22.080
She has been a married woman with three children

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.800
who are Realized souls. Our interest was in her

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.280
about her children because we knew about her,

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:30.560
but her children were very good.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:35.440
And when she came to Me, I told her that, “See, we can’t do much about you,

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:38.800
I’m sorry. But in a way, but you have to work hard

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.000
if you are willing to cooperate”.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.440
“Oh, I’m willing to cooperate, Mother, I want to say I’m willing to.”

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.560
Then I discovered that she was actually ill-treating her husband,

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:53.600
ill-treating the children. And every time I tried

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:56.320
to raise her Kundalini, it was a big labouring thing,

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.520
I mean it’s really hard work with such people.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:02.560
I used to say, “Oh God, next time I hope I don’t see her face somehow,

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.680
it’s too much”. And the whole attention goes to something so nonsensical

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:08.560
and useless person. I mean, in that time you can give

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:13.200
Realization to so many people. And she would attract the sympathy

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:20.000
of some here and there. Then ultimately, I raised I think

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.711
Kundalini thrice and I told her, “You’ve got it,

00:06:22.711 --> 00:06:28.640
you’ve touched your Realization, but you have to now promise Me

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:33.520
that you will not ill-treat your husband and not ill-treat your children”.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:36.880
And she said, “Mother, you have to promise me that my Realization

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.560
will be established”. I said, “All right, promised,

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:42.080
but you must promise Me this. Start it that way”.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:46.000
Imagine to be ill-treating your own husband and your own children!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:50.960
I mean, I haven’t got sufficient time to be with my children,

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.440
to express my love. And here is a person,

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:59.160
sitting down quietly with three children and just thinking how to torture them.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:02.640
It’s a very difficult case, I felt, with this woman.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:07.760
Very fond of living like a lady-like personality, this and that.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:11.600
But she couldn’t do that. Every time her Kundalini fell down.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.920
You see, she used to think she’s obliging Me all the time,

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:17.680
that’s her funny stuff. And she thought that I promised her

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:21.680
and how is it not established?

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:25.592
And then, I think people told her that, “You’d better not come to Sahaja Yoga,

00:07:25.592 --> 00:07:27.920
we have had enough of it”. She stopped the children,

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:33.520
she never brought them. We said, “All right, finished”.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:38.837
But, you see, negativity is such that they know they have no personality.

00:07:38.837 --> 00:07:40.679
Otherwise, without Sahaja Yoga what is their personality?

00:07:40.679 --> 00:07:48.632
They are nothing. So, she tried to assert herself

00:07:48.632 --> 00:07:55.120
all the time, and this time she appeared where we had gone

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.960
and she just came by herself. I never called her nor did I ask her

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:06.000
to come, but she was just there. And I asked Rita, how is she here?

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.120
She said, “Mother, she is here because she said that You told her”.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:12.160
I said, “I?” She said, “Yes, You were in her head and told her”.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.804
“I’m neither in her heart nor in her head.

00:08:14.804 --> 00:08:16.385
So, how am I going to tell her?”.

00:08:16.385 --> 00:08:19.920
So, she came in. Now, I found Rita had a weakness

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:31.040
for this lady. So, something was to be done because I wanted to save Rita.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:34.235
My foot went absolutely crazy with this woman, I told Gavin,

00:08:34.235 --> 00:08:43.520
“I don’t know what to do”. But the Divine has its own methods

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:51.520
and she suddenly got exposed completely. And Rita was shocked the way she was.

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:55.596
Because she just started fighting with Me, absolutely fighting with Me.

00:08:55.596 --> 00:09:02.320
And so rude and so shameless. Rita couldn’t believe her eyes.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:08.800
So, I was very happy in a way, she said, “Now it’s finished, it’s good is over,

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:12.480
because she was always pestering me. And I told her that, “If Mother

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:15.680
doesn’t want and if it is not allowed, how can I do it?”.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:18.160
And she always used to say, “Do this, do that”.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:22.960
Now, why I am telling you this story is that when she went to India,

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:28.920
everybody resisted her. And in India, you see, Sahaja Yogis come,

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:31.760
and really, you know, people are very highly developed Sahaja Yogis.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:34.720
And she was literally frightened of them because she was quite aware

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:38.400
of the nonsense that she was up to, and her cunning and all that.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:41.360
And it came up to this point, the way she behaved there

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:46.080
and the way she created scenes and things and all such nonsense, that they said,

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.712
“We are going to book her back. She has to go back otherwise

00:09:48.712 --> 00:09:53.478
we’ll throw her in the sea, Mother, we can’t have her anymore.”

00:09:53.478 --> 00:09:57.127
I got frightened, I said, “All right”. Now, the main thing we have to understand

00:09:57.127 --> 00:10:00.960
is that how much time do we spend with these people?

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:10.400
We must learn how much, you must judge the depth of a seeker.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.640
That’s very important, because we haven’t got time

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:14.560
to waste much.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:18.720
And if you don’t get anybody in England anymore, let’s go to India.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:22.640
If not India, let’s go to China. We have to gather human beings;

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:25.360
we are not bothered to what country they belong to.

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:30.160
You have to weigh first of all the quality and you’ll find,

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:34.240
you’ll be amazed, those people who you think to be very much qualified,

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:38.400
you’ll find them to be useless people. And the Divine will not help you.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.880
The best part of it is that the Divine will not help you.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:45.862
It will be angry with you for wasting your time on such a person.

00:10:45.862 --> 00:10:48.480
And as you will be growing, you will definitely have

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.360
this discrimination within yourself and you will understand.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:55.600
You will not waste your energy with someone like that.

00:10:55.600 --> 00:11:00.240
All this idea of being kind to everyone is not for us.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:05.040
We have to be kind to ourselves and to God.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:09.520
And all such useless people have to go out of the circulation of evolution.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:13.040
Absolutely, there is no doubt about it. And this is what I want to tell you

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:18.400
that today I want you to ask the questions. That’s important.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:23.600
And when you ask the questions, I will see how they answer.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:29.600
Now to be positive, a person has to see how the question is asked

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:34.240
and how it is answered. It’s not a question of your mind,

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:39.840
it’s a question of spirituality. The question is from spirituality

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:45.120
to spirituality. It’s not from one mind to another mind,

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:48.720
and I would like to see that, how it works out with Sahaja Yogis.

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:51.120
Because I know you are people of very high quality

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:56.720
and that’s how I know all this great work is going to be done.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:12:01.336
In one year, I have seen people have come up so much.

00:12:01.336 --> 00:12:02.293
Thank you, thank you.

00:12:02.293 --> 00:12:05.520
They have come up so much, they have gone so much up

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:11.760
and they have done so much. But there are some who are struggling

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:15.400
and they cannot come up. Some people don’t feel vibrations,

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:19.920
it doesn’t matter. Need not feel vibrations constantly,

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:24.080
maybe some physical problem is there or some sort of problem is there.

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:28.320
But the main thing is the attitude of a person is important;

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:38.000
and negative people are there to take our time, to divert us,

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:38.720
our attention.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:42.080
They’ll go into tantrums, they’ll show-off, they’ll do this,

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:46.880
they’ll do that, and they’ll try to divert our attention to them,

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:50.800
attention from the Spirit, attention from our ascent,

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:53.760
attention from our work that is so important –

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:58.560
the emancipation of the whole humanity.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:05.200
So, we must understand that our lives are valuable lives. We are Sahaja Yogis.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.240
We are workers of God. Our Kundalini has arisen,

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:12.880
we are Realized souls of a very high quality

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:18.080
and we have not to waste our energy to people who do not deserve

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.800
our attention. That’s very important, between you and Me,

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:25.760
I am telling you this story. It’s all right what I do.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.880
It’s different, I play quite a lot of things with them.

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:33.280
And I see to it that they get out. But you please don’t waste your energy.

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:40.240
If you find somebody difficult, funny, better give up that person.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:46.160
Now with this idea, we’ll have about one person from every country.

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:51.680
We’ll sit down here and I would like to see. And you should all ask questions.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:58.640
Questions, not material, but about Kundalini,

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:01.840
about what answers to be given, because now as you are all going

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:07.280
in the fields, you know people ask you questions, and what questions they ask,

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:11.360
and how to answer these questions, so we can sort it out just now.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:14.080
Because sometimes, they can be so aggressive

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:19.280
that you can be just dumbfounded. But as I said, after a certain time,

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:23.440
you should just give them up as lost. It’s not our responsibility

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:28.080
to give Realization to everyone. It’s not expected.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.400
It’s only those who deserve that will get it.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:34.160
It’s the deserving quality of people that’s important.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:37.360
If they are not deserving, we are not interested in them.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:45.760
We are sufficient already. Better – I always say that those people

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:52.960
who are to enter into the Kingdom of God should only enter,

00:14:52.960 --> 00:15:01.680
and not every Dick, Tom, and Harry. It’s important.

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:05.280
So, those people who cause problems, just do it because,

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:12.160
to attract our attention. And Sahaja Yoga, you know, as it is,

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:16.960
it’s very different from other so-called organizations of God.

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:21.280
Here the genuineness is judged by vibrations and by the attitude

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:25.520
of a person. You have to be extremely positive.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:29.596
I’ve seen even some cancer patients who came to Sahaja Yoga

00:15:29.596 --> 00:15:34.000
who are so very positive, it’s surprising.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:39.520
And some people, for nothing at all, they are wasting your time and energy.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:45.600
So, the interest should be for the people who are of quality,

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:50.640
and not for people who are just wasting our time and energy.

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:54.560
It’s a kind of an ego within us there I think, that we try to correct people

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:59.520
who are good for nothing. Give them up. It’s all right, they are hard nuts,

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:04.800
why should we break our teeth for that?

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:07.960
This is what I want to tell you. After this experience, now,

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:11.040
Rita has said, taken a vow that she’ll have nothing to do

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:13.280
with Peggy. You see, always she used to peg her down

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:16.320
to Me every time. Rita used to telephone to Me about her,

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:18.800
she used to tell Me, “Mother, please look after her,

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:23.280
all the Sahaja Yogis are angry”. Especially, she said, “People have told

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:28.160
her off and she cannot come to the programs”. That’s how it was.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:33.200
So, thank God now she’s corrected. I’ve tried my own ways.

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:39.360
But you can directly understand and know that. You know in your heart

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:45.280
who is settled, and who is not settled. You know very well about everyone.

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:49.600
You are quite capable. But if you try to be extremely,

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:51.920
“Now, let it be, let it be, it’s all right”…

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:56.320
They are no good. They can never come up. So why waste your energy?

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.840
Simple thing is that if you are very good or bad, or if you are hard to them,

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.901
they are just the same to you. As Sahaja Yogis,

00:17:01.901 --> 00:17:06.720
we have to realize our position. The work is very important.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:12.000
It’s not that we are here for England or America or for China,

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:15.520
we are for the whole world. Whenever we get people of that quality,

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:21.840
we are going to collect and decamp. All right?

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:26.800
Now. So, I would say that we’ll get some people here, like from every country

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:30.594
that – you be there.

00:17:30.594 --> 00:17:31.760
Or, maybe Brian could come first.

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.160
Brian also. No, Brian should ask questions first of all,

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:41.280
then I will put you down in his place and you’ll sit in his.

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:44.520
All right. Then – Gavin, you come along from England.

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:48.320
Because you have to answer. Everybody has to ask

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:53.360
because it’s a ‘one answer’. Then I think Christine can come,

00:17:53.360 --> 00:18:08.160
from America. Marie can come from France. Magda, you come from Switzerland.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:13.580
All right, now nobody is higher or lower. You see, they are asking the questions

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:20.560
that have to be asked. Need not be answered.

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:25.029
If it cannot be answered, one should not worry.

00:18:25.029 --> 00:18:28.480
But anyone of you can answer the questions.

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:33.520
Now there are so many intelligent and intellectuals

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:39.200
and over-educated people. The ones who have to ask the questions

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:44.240
are always better placed than the people who have to answer. All right?

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:48.480
So, in a way I would like to see how the questions are asked

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:51.585
and what answer is given. I would like to see the game,

00:18:51.585 --> 00:19:01.474
I’ll let you play. All right. Can you ask to get Me a cup of tea?

00:19:01.474 --> 00:19:02.378
A cup of tea? Would one of the ladies get Mother

00:19:02.378 --> 00:19:04.263
a cup of tea, please?

00:19:04.263 --> 00:19:07.976
And, yesterday’s speech was really beautiful, very beautiful….

00:19:07.976 --> 00:19:17.700
Yes, come along and sit. Now, you must know, there are great

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.760
intellectuals sitting here. Be careful, all right.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:26.590
So, we are very friendly and nice. Who else from which countries is here?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:27.979
Spain, someone?

00:19:27.979 --> 00:19:28.697
No.

00:19:28.697 --> 00:19:29.742
There is Robert’s from Belgium.

00:19:29.742 --> 00:19:31.431
Is he there, Robert? Where is he?

00:19:31.431 --> 00:19:36.620
Yes. Robert?

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:37.660
Ah, great, come along, come along. So happy to know what you have done!

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:39.838
Really remarkable, I must really say. Robert, I really say:

00:19:39.838 --> 00:19:42.657
what a man he was, what a man! May God bless you.

00:19:59.766 --> 00:20:00.228
Do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:00.228 --> 00:20:04.160
you remember how we shut off, you see, that horrible Rajneesh [Osho]?

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:14.320
From their seminar, how we shut off! Remember him? Brahmam Gardens?

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:14.501
Yes.

00:20:14.501 --> 00:20:18.546
May God bless you. I’m very proud of you.

00:20:18.546 --> 00:20:20.480
You must know. My ego again is allowing me

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.600
to go into this. Ok?

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:29.840
That’s going in the same way! That should be the right type of ego.

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:33.760
That type, that ego is a better type where you question the wrong type

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:38.228
of a person. But that ego which questions the right type of person

00:20:38.228 --> 00:20:43.280
is a stupid ego, because it has no sense, it has no wisdom.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:49.593
But, you see, from him to come, it’s hell I tell you,

00:20:49.593 --> 00:20:55.587
he’s come out of hell, I mean, you see, he’s sickening, he sickens people.

00:20:55.587 --> 00:20:57.680
Most horrid. Most of the people whom I know who were with him,

00:20:57.680 --> 00:21:02.773
about, say, in the beginning of it, they are now staying in a lunatic asylum,

00:21:02.773 --> 00:21:04.160
most of them. Or down with cancer, down with cancer,

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:09.360
another thing I must tell you. Those, now they have, have been with him

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:12.000
for years now, down with cancer.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:16.320
I saw pictures of him, recent pictures, where he wears…

00:21:17.475 --> 00:21:18.195
Gloves?

00:21:18.195 --> 00:21:21.529
Yes. He wears now gloves.

00:21:21.529 --> 00:21:22.320
Why?

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:33.240
And a big warm tailcoat. I think he is crazy, he starts to…

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:41.760
Because I had to vomit from this picture.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:54.778
Let him not die, because otherwise he will be more troublesome.

00:21:54.778 --> 00:21:58.400
But it’s all right. All right, now, so please make yourself comfortable.

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:08.000
Now, you sit down. Now, most of the people who are

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:11.360
real Sahaja Yogis should ask questions and not those who are really

00:22:11.360 --> 00:22:16.880
just too weak and …, all right. Because they, still I know they,

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:19.840
they have to reach a certain stage of understanding.

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:31.116
All right, from Sahaja Yogis only. Don’t become thoughtless aware.

00:22:31.116 --> 00:22:32.149
You said, “Not mind to mind”.

00:22:32.149 --> 00:22:39.120
All right. Not mind to mind, all right. But let the inspiration come.

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:46.000
That it should lead you all from the beginning to a point!

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:54.640
So in every day-to-day life, when you have been facing other people

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:58.000
in Sahaja Yoga. You should ask questions about that,

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:03.520
what happened, what questions they asked, what were the problems.

00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:11.600
So, Fergy, why are you taking My photograph? All right?

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:18.640
Because, you see, now you should take their photograph.

00:23:18.640 --> 00:23:24.000
Would be nice expressions. All right? Three on this side

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:27.440
and three on this side, and I am the seventh point. Good.

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:41.989
Let’s have it now. Ah, that’s it, that’s a good idea. Now, come along.

00:23:41.989 --> 00:23:43.040
All right. Yes, say.

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:47.520
What would you say to somebody who comes up to you and says

00:23:47.520 --> 00:23:52.714
very concernedly: ‘What is the difference between Sahaja Yoga and these…’.

00:23:52.714 --> 00:23:53.512
What is it?

00:23:53.512 --> 00:23:58.720
What is the difference between what you are doing and what these cults

00:23:58.720 --> 00:24:02.080
or these other gurus are doing? They all seem to say the same thing,

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:03.120
I mean, they do.

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:04.800
They are using the same language.

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:05.991
Using the same language.

00:24:05.991 --> 00:24:08.000
You see, because in 1970, I was in America,

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.400
they have picked up everything.

00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:10.080
Everything.

00:24:10.080 --> 00:24:14.560
And a gentleman told Me, warned Me. He told Me: “Mother, You’d better get

00:24:14.560 --> 00:24:16.720
all your tapes” – what you call them?

00:24:18.960 --> 00:24:20.140
Copyright.

00:24:20.140 --> 00:24:23.120
Copyright! You see. I said: “Why?” He said: “No, these all Your words,

00:24:23.120 --> 00:24:26.638
‘vibrations’, this, that, will be used by these people, ‘chakras’ everything”.

00:24:26.638 --> 00:24:32.880
I said: “Very good!” But ultimately, they have to come to Me for Realization.

00:24:32.880 --> 00:24:37.440
But they are using the same, I agree with you, but doesn’t matter.

00:24:37.440 --> 00:24:43.120
Now, tell him: What’s the difference between the technique of Sahaja Yoga

00:24:43.120 --> 00:24:48.320
and the technique of these people? They use the same words.

00:24:49.920 --> 00:24:58.480
Let’s have another person, who? Warren?

00:24:58.480 --> 00:25:03.200
The basic difference that I feel, Mother, is that, in Sahaja Yoga,

00:25:03.200 --> 00:25:06.800
it’s not the promise of an experience, it’s the actualization.

00:25:06.800 --> 00:25:10.000
Something actually happens in the presence of Mataji

00:25:10.000 --> 00:25:15.360
or other Realized souls. And you get it.

00:25:15.360 --> 00:25:17.760
They also get experiences, Mother.

00:25:17.760 --> 00:25:19.819
They get an experience.

00:25:19.819 --> 00:25:19.840
They get experiences.

00:25:19.840 --> 00:25:25.760
Now, your turn. Now, let’s see.

00:25:25.760 --> 00:25:31.920
One thing that you can explain is whether they keep the freedom

00:25:31.920 --> 00:25:35.840
of the individual or whether the individual is actually maneuvered.

00:25:35.840 --> 00:25:37.800
And you can explain.

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:40.000
No, that one you wouldn’t know. That how can you tell if you are

00:25:40.000 --> 00:25:43.680
mesmerized or not – unmesmerized?

00:25:43.680 --> 00:25:45.840
Yes, if you are in Sahaja, you don’t know.

00:25:45.840 --> 00:25:49.840
But if you look from the other side and you’re asking, you can ask the people

00:25:49.840 --> 00:25:55.600
to see how does it work, do you feel that these people are free

00:25:55.600 --> 00:26:01.200
in what they are doing? Do you feel that they doing it

00:26:01.200 --> 00:26:05.520
out of their own freewill? Do they look like individuals?

00:26:08.400 --> 00:26:13.040
If you go there, are you taught to think for yourself?

00:26:13.040 --> 00:26:20.960
And is it something where your freedom is respected?

00:26:20.960 --> 00:26:25.600
Because a lot of the other ones – you can explain that to people –

00:26:25.600 --> 00:26:31.600
is that people are taken in charge, and they are taken in charge

00:26:31.600 --> 00:26:36.000
morning till evening and even during the night. They never have to learn

00:26:36.000 --> 00:26:41.920
and they do this, do that, sing and pray, and do whatever, and they never stop.

00:26:41.920 --> 00:26:47.520
And they’re actually made to fit into a mould and once they are

00:26:47.520 --> 00:26:50.240
nicely shaped, they can’t get out of it.

00:26:50.240 --> 00:26:53.680
You mean they don’t understand what they are doing.

00:26:53.680 --> 00:26:59.360
Eventually, they don’t. They’re fitted into something

00:26:59.360 --> 00:27:04.240
and it’s some weakness from their left side which makes them want to be led.

00:27:04.240 --> 00:27:08.560
And it’s something that you still find in Sahaja Yogis, if you look carefully

00:27:08.560 --> 00:27:14.160
in yourself, we all still got that. And we all have to be careful of it.

00:27:14.160 --> 00:27:19.760
Because it’s still there, this tendency to want to fit into an organisation,

00:27:19.760 --> 00:27:25.400
be a “something” and not be who you are.

00:27:25.400 --> 00:27:25.840
Yes.

00:27:25.840 --> 00:27:28.320
And go through with it, go and look at yourself

00:27:28.320 --> 00:27:31.200
and go through with it. And that’s the way it works,

00:27:31.200 --> 00:27:37.440
people are told that you, you know, think to be nice and all this,

00:27:37.440 --> 00:27:41.040
and all that. But basically, they are taken in charge.

00:27:41.040 --> 00:27:45.920
And then they don’t think for themselves. And the language, yes, is correct,

00:27:45.920 --> 00:27:49.920
but you have to see the results. If you want facts, there are plenty

00:27:49.920 --> 00:27:53.760
of facts, and these people got filed, I mean, a [inaudible] of files

00:27:53.760 --> 00:27:58.480
on what happened to people going there. And what state they are in,

00:27:58.480 --> 00:28:03.520
if you manage to get them out, if ever. And that’s where the difference is.

00:28:03.520 --> 00:28:07.200
It’s very weird, you know, the Sahaj is absolutely different,

00:28:07.200 --> 00:28:09.360
it’s rather weird I should say. All right, let’s see.

00:28:09.360 --> 00:28:11.280
Whatever she has to say. Let’s see.

00:28:11.280 --> 00:28:13.600
Mother, there are two points that we usually make.

00:28:13.600 --> 00:28:18.240
One is that you can’t pay for it and then you don’t pay for it.

00:28:18.240 --> 00:28:22.720
And this especially comes up in America because there are people who are used

00:28:22.720 --> 00:28:24.194
to pay for absolutely everything.

00:28:24.194 --> 00:28:26.240
Everything is valuable. That’s all I can see.

00:28:26.240 --> 00:28:30.509
You go to this introduction, and that introduction,

00:28:30.560 --> 00:28:33.200
quite always that way. It’s not like over here.

00:28:33.200 --> 00:28:33.760
All right.

00:28:33.760 --> 00:28:40.480
So, that’s something that attracts a lot of people if they are used

00:28:40.480 --> 00:28:45.360
to paying for things, you know, if this is a sort of way over there.

00:28:45.360 --> 00:28:49.320
And you say: “You cannot pay for it; we won’t accept payments”.

00:28:49.320 --> 00:28:52.960
And in fact, it would be sort of an insult, because it is

00:28:52.960 --> 00:28:54.320
your own birthright.”

00:28:54.320 --> 00:28:58.640
But that’s the gross. But what happens to the subtle?

00:28:58.640 --> 00:29:00.210
The subtle is…

00:29:00.210 --> 00:29:00.226
In a subtle way.

00:29:00.226 --> 00:29:06.000
The subtle is the Kundalini is awakened. And the great thing about that

00:29:06.000 --> 00:29:08.480
is that you become collectively conscious,

00:29:08.480 --> 00:29:12.960
which is something that can’t be faked. You cannot fake

00:29:12.960 --> 00:29:17.200
Collective Consciousness. And it’s very simple,

00:29:17.200 --> 00:29:22.240
you can give an example. If you blindfold several children

00:29:22.240 --> 00:29:26.560
and you haven’t – who are Realized – and you haven’t tried the vibrations

00:29:26.560 --> 00:29:31.920
in somebody, they will all feel the same thing. And children don’t fake

00:29:31.920 --> 00:29:35.440
and everybody knows that. If they try the vibrations

00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:39.840
of somebody else, they don’t feel something different. So, this is

00:29:41.120 --> 00:29:46.400
an important distinction to make.

00:29:46.400 --> 00:29:51.360
Now let’s have your answers, Gavin. You go forward by the things

00:29:51.360 --> 00:29:56.080
she’s covered, while trying to expand some points.

00:29:56.080 --> 00:29:58.240
The most important thing about Sahaja Yoga,

00:29:58.240 --> 00:30:04.080
is not what experience it gives you, I mean that you get.

00:30:04.080 --> 00:30:07.120
But what you have to tell people who ask what’s the difference

00:30:07.120 --> 00:30:13.040
is what do the disciples become, what powers do they get,

00:30:13.040 --> 00:30:16.355
what experience can they give to other people?

00:30:16.355 --> 00:30:18.560
Yes. Yes.

00:30:18.560 --> 00:30:25.120
Because without the capacity to enlighten others, then it is not

00:30:25.120 --> 00:30:32.440
a very important enlightenment at all.

00:30:32.440 --> 00:30:37.520
Yes.

00:30:37.520 --> 00:30:40.000
So, this is the guideline.

00:30:40.000 --> 00:30:45.520
This is an identity thing. Now, what about you? Thank you.

00:30:45.520 --> 00:30:49.280
Maybe another point also is that Sahaja Yoga is the truth.

00:30:49.280 --> 00:30:54.320
The truth is eternal. So, you might also be able to relate it

00:30:54.320 --> 00:30:57.280
with other scriptures, to know who Christ was,

00:30:57.280 --> 00:31:01.840
to know who Mohamed, who Buddha was. And nobody can tell you in this group

00:31:01.840 --> 00:31:06.960
and make relationship where they are in you, how you can imbibe them into you.

00:31:06.960 --> 00:31:14.080
And not only about the great Prophets, but also with everything, with nature,

00:31:14.080 --> 00:31:22.240
music, science, astrology. Everything is [inaudible].

00:31:24.080 --> 00:31:28.720
And you can even see this, everything is part of it.

00:31:28.720 --> 00:31:37.028
Now Robert, what do you have to say?

00:31:37.028 --> 00:31:42.960
One can say that in other sects, they don’t get real powers.

00:31:42.960 --> 00:31:52.471
Actually, I experienced that they get powers, they can put bhoots in you.

00:31:52.471 --> 00:31:53.840
They get the bhoot’s powers. It’s true, yes!

00:31:53.840 --> 00:32:06.240
Yes, absolutely. But what can we say? Use your common sense.

00:32:06.240 --> 00:32:10.720
Go and see any sect – I don’t know if it is intelligent to say that

00:32:10.720 --> 00:32:23.520
“Do the experience”. I experienced a tremendous destroying force.

00:32:23.520 --> 00:32:31.760
Because when I met Mother, I, first of all, I got all my stomach,

00:32:33.120 --> 00:32:37.920
something coming out, dirt coming out, in skin, you know.

00:32:37.920 --> 00:32:44.000
That was a proof that negativity came out. That something happened,

00:32:44.000 --> 00:32:51.080
that something really happened in me. Actually, I had not such a proof

00:32:51.080 --> 00:33:01.360
in this sect. I only got into their catastrophic thing.

00:33:01.360 --> 00:33:04.160
But you’ve not been a long time with him.

00:33:04.160 --> 00:33:12.720
I was not so long, five months. So, I felt also one another thing,

00:33:12.720 --> 00:33:18.496
the fact that Mother is so illusive for seekers. That’s a good thing.

00:33:19.840 --> 00:33:24.720
The fact that Mother is so – doesn’t possess, really.

00:33:24.720 --> 00:33:30.160
Because I was so greedy, I remember. The first time I met You,

00:33:30.160 --> 00:33:44.743
it was the second program, you didn’t look at me.

00:33:44.743 --> 00:33:47.743
Yes, very clever.

00:33:47.743 --> 00:33:53.320
You are very clever.

00:33:53.320 --> 00:33:57.280
See that. From where does the cleverness come there, eh?

00:33:57.280 --> 00:34:04.480
All right, now, after all these things, I would like one of you to answer

00:34:04.480 --> 00:34:10.080
this question. Anyone, let’s have. Bala, you come along.

00:34:10.080 --> 00:34:13.760
Let’s have your answer. Stand up, let’s hear.

00:34:13.760 --> 00:34:24.880
Come up here, let’s see. Here.

00:34:24.880 --> 00:34:30.080
Well, I think the point Gavin brought up is relevant.

00:34:30.080 --> 00:34:34.640
But what you can tell them is if you get a power, if it’s bhoot, all right,

00:34:34.640 --> 00:34:39.200
it makes you feel powerful. But in Sahaja Yoga, you can actually

00:34:39.200 --> 00:34:44.480
raise other people’s Kundalini and you can empower them

00:34:44.480 --> 00:34:48.720
with the ability to raise Kundalini. For instance, for me, the proof was

00:34:48.720 --> 00:34:52.320
I stood behind some new person, I just got him to sit in front

00:34:52.320 --> 00:34:55.600
of this photograph. I didn’t explain anything, I stood behind him

00:34:55.600 --> 00:35:01.120
and I started moving as Mother had showed us in Gavin’s house.

00:35:01.120 --> 00:35:04.640
And things started happening to him and he began to feel within him

00:35:04.640 --> 00:35:08.080
things happening, and he felt his Kundalini rising

00:35:08.080 --> 00:35:11.600
and he began to feel the joy. And I think that is

00:35:11.600 --> 00:35:15.840
the most important thing, that you can transmit this awakening

00:35:15.840 --> 00:35:22.160
to other people and raise their Kundalini rather than just feeling empowering you.

00:35:22.160 --> 00:35:29.120
Something which could be bhoots. And I don’t know if bhoots can do that.

00:35:29.120 --> 00:35:43.040
All right, thank you very much. Now. You see, always the artificial

00:35:43.040 --> 00:35:48.240
has to copy the real. It is always so. Artificial has to copy the real,

00:35:48.240 --> 00:35:52.400
otherwise it won’t sell! Of course, outwardly in the gross

00:35:52.400 --> 00:36:00.080
we can say that artificial can sell, the real is spontaneous.

00:36:00.080 --> 00:36:05.440
Or artificial can put up a show, the real does not.

00:36:05.440 --> 00:36:09.680
The artificial is more earnest, because it has to sell,

00:36:09.680 --> 00:36:16.800
while the real is least bothered as he said about Me. It’s correct.

00:36:16.800 --> 00:36:24.549
But beyond that, how to make out an artificial from the real?

00:36:24.549 --> 00:36:28.320
It’s the problem, because they have the same style of thing

00:36:28.320 --> 00:36:32.800
and these people say that, “We are in the same thing,

00:36:32.800 --> 00:36:35.760
we are having vibrations, we have energy,

00:36:35.760 --> 00:36:42.640
we are raising the Kundalini”, to everything they go.

00:36:42.640 --> 00:36:48.781
Now the best thing would be to be extremely practical

00:36:48.781 --> 00:36:52.720
with these people. First of all, you must judge whether they are seekers

00:36:52.720 --> 00:37:01.120
or not. Then you should see what chakras are catching.

00:37:01.120 --> 00:37:05.200
You see, you move on another line. They move on another line

00:37:05.200 --> 00:37:09.200
because you are empowered. So, you just see what chakras

00:37:09.200 --> 00:37:14.000
are catching on them. If you answer them directly,

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:23.920
they will come out with another answer. So, when they say something to you,

00:37:23.920 --> 00:37:26.720
you must know that if they are bhoots, and they are possessed,

00:37:26.720 --> 00:37:30.080
then they know your bhoots also. Not only that, but they can read

00:37:30.080 --> 00:37:32.720
your mind, that’s one of the powers of bhoots. Because they can live

00:37:32.720 --> 00:37:36.080
on mental level, they can live on the physical level,

00:37:36.080 --> 00:37:42.160
they can live on other levels like – you see, whatever past you have had

00:37:42.160 --> 00:37:44.560
they can tell you, they can tell your future.

00:37:44.560 --> 00:37:48.480
They can go up to that point. They can tell you about your future,

00:37:48.480 --> 00:37:51.600
they can tell you about past, they can tell you about

00:37:51.600 --> 00:37:59.120
your mental problems, your brother, father.

00:37:59.120 --> 00:38:02.320
They may even tell you when you have lost your properties

00:38:02.320 --> 00:38:11.120
or where you have kept your ornaments and who is the thief.

00:38:11.120 --> 00:38:17.200
All these things they can tell you. Because their interest is material,

00:38:17.200 --> 00:38:20.320
so they know everything about it and they can tell you.

00:38:20.320 --> 00:38:27.920
Now you are facing a person like that. So he reads your mind, all right.

00:38:29.040 --> 00:38:35.200
So, when he – you confront such a person, to deal with the person

00:38:35.200 --> 00:38:43.600
is to just get quiet. Get into your thoughtless awareness.

00:38:43.600 --> 00:38:45.600
Be quiet. Your fortress is

00:38:45.600 --> 00:38:52.240
your thoughtless awareness because you are real.

00:38:52.240 --> 00:39:02.480
And try to see his Kundalini, try to raise it and see where it stops.

00:39:02.480 --> 00:39:06.560
Now, he says, “Why don’t you answer?”. You say that, “I’m still –

00:39:06.560 --> 00:39:09.916
let me hear you, I have to hear you”. All right?

00:39:09.916 --> 00:39:17.840
So, show all the patience now, try to raise his Kundalini.

00:39:17.840 --> 00:39:22.080
Now if the Kundalini, you see, is absolutely useless, doesn’t rise,

00:39:22.080 --> 00:39:30.320
you should say, “All right, I give up. Finished”. Nothing more.

00:39:30.320 --> 00:39:36.160
Our real nature as he said, he used… there is a word for the Goddess

00:39:36.160 --> 00:39:40.360
is ‘Nirmama’. She doesn’t get attached to anyone. She cannot.

00:39:40.360 --> 00:39:43.120
If She is the energy for the whole universe,

00:39:43.120 --> 00:39:46.880
how can She get attached to anyone, to any personally?

00:39:46.880 --> 00:39:50.880
Only She can nourish, and the nourishment can only go if the persons

00:39:50.880 --> 00:39:54.320
are willing to take the nourishment. You are on the giving stage;

00:39:54.320 --> 00:39:58.080
you are not on the taking stage. If the other person doesn’t want

00:39:58.080 --> 00:40:03.600
to have it, you can’t open the mouth and pour it in the mouth.

00:40:03.600 --> 00:40:12.480
So, when such a person comes in, you just get into your meditative mood.

00:40:12.480 --> 00:40:17.600
And you will be amazed the dynamism of the Spirit will beat them

00:40:17.600 --> 00:40:22.520
at that time. Now, maybe it stops at Nabhi.

00:40:23.280 --> 00:40:30.720
Supposing the question at Nabhi stops, the right Nabhi. So, you know,

00:40:30.720 --> 00:40:38.560
he is a liver patient. All right? You can ask him questions about liver.

00:40:38.560 --> 00:40:43.765
He’ll be amazed that you know that he has a liver trouble.

00:40:43.765 --> 00:40:48.960
It stops at right Heart. You just ask him the questions

00:40:48.960 --> 00:40:53.360
about the right Heart. “You just tell me these things,

00:40:53.360 --> 00:41:00.960
then I’ll tell you what it is”. Like, I’ll tell you, Douglas.

00:41:00.960 --> 00:41:07.200
Douglas is not such an intellectual, thank God. And David Prole, you see,

00:41:07.200 --> 00:41:10.720
just saw My photograph, and went into contortions.

00:41:10.720 --> 00:41:16.800
And he telephoned in the ashram and Douglas received it.

00:41:16.800 --> 00:41:22.640
And he said, “Who are you?”. He said, “I’m Douglas,

00:41:22.640 --> 00:41:26.400
I’m a Sahaja Yogi”. “Really, what is Sahaja Yoga is?”

00:41:26.400 --> 00:41:28.480
He said: “By the way, are you perspiring too much?”

00:41:28.480 --> 00:41:31.000
He said, “Yes I’m boiling while talking to you”.

00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:33.600
“You see, that’s it. Have you been to TM?”

00:41:33.600 --> 00:41:37.600
He said, “Yes, how do you know?” “I know, because such chakras

00:41:37.600 --> 00:41:40.953
are catching”. He said, “Surprising, these people,

00:41:40.953 --> 00:41:45.520
how do they know?”. Then he told Me he came home

00:41:45.520 --> 00:41:50.680
and Rustom opened the book, I think he took My name or I think,

00:41:50.680 --> 00:41:53.760
he took the name of the Goddess or whatever it is. And he just went

00:41:53.760 --> 00:41:57.200
into contortions again. He said, “What have you started?”

00:41:57.200 --> 00:42:00.560
Actually, he got frightened, Rustom, and he telephoned to Me:

00:42:00.560 --> 00:42:05.200
‘Mother, what’s happening to him?”. I said, “See, that’s your name”.

00:42:05.200 --> 00:42:11.280
So, your powers are divine powers. Never forget that. On arguments,

00:42:11.280 --> 00:42:17.669
then once you have given them Realization, then start your arguments

00:42:17.669 --> 00:42:20.800
with them. But you can do it with your attention.

00:42:20.800 --> 00:42:24.400
You give them Realization and then the arguments can be given.

00:42:25.280 --> 00:42:31.276
Because when I’m discussing with them, actually I’m raising their Kundalini.

00:42:31.276 --> 00:42:36.160
And outwardly I’m discussing you see, everybody thinks Mother is talking

00:42:36.160 --> 00:42:40.440
to them, [inaudible] sometimes. But I’m really raising their Kundalini

00:42:40.440 --> 00:42:47.280
inside. So, first of all try to raise their Kundalini, because that works.

00:42:47.280 --> 00:42:50.800
Now, you know for definite what is the difference between

00:42:50.800 --> 00:43:00.800
the real and the unreal. That unreal is that a myth,

00:43:00.800 --> 00:43:08.320
that, ‘This is a snake’, is a myth. But when the light comes in,

00:43:08.320 --> 00:43:16.880
you know it is not. Then, the light has come in you.

00:43:16.880 --> 00:43:21.280
Even small children, as they said, they know.

00:43:21.280 --> 00:43:26.320
You have got your own powers, no doubt about it.

00:43:26.320 --> 00:43:29.920
You can raise your Kundalini, no doubt about it.

00:43:29.920 --> 00:43:34.880
You can raise others’ Kundalini, no doubt. You can cure people, no doubt.

00:43:34.880 --> 00:43:40.206
For that, if you have to give an example, I have cured even the president of India.

00:43:40.206 --> 00:43:46.320
Now you yourself cannot certified that. Then, coming to the mental side of it,

00:43:46.320 --> 00:43:49.520
how you have achieved you know, you have given up all your habits,

00:43:49.520 --> 00:43:53.600
then you have become a better person. While people who belong to another cult,

00:43:53.600 --> 00:43:58.960
they do not give up any habits. On the contrary, they become just slaves.

00:43:58.960 --> 00:44:02.000
Just slaves! They are not independent, as he said,

00:44:02.000 --> 00:44:07.280
that they are not individuals. They become all slaves together

00:44:07.280 --> 00:44:14.000
and they behave – collectivity to them is just slavery. Apart from that,

00:44:14.000 --> 00:44:17.840
your knowledge is tremendous. You know why you do puja,

00:44:17.840 --> 00:44:21.200
you know why you make mantras, you know what mantras to say,

00:44:21.200 --> 00:44:26.160
when to say, how to raise it and the whole science of it.

00:44:26.160 --> 00:44:32.640
Even their gurus, gurus never do the science that you do.

00:44:32.640 --> 00:44:40.000
All the techniques, Nirmala Vidya, you know. So, all the points

00:44:40.000 --> 00:44:44.560
that they said that you have your own powers. You can ask them,

00:44:44.560 --> 00:44:50.480
“Can you feel me?” “Yes, yes, we are feeling very hot.”

00:44:50.480 --> 00:44:56.080
All right. That’s all. But you should say, “I’m feeling you.

00:44:56.080 --> 00:45:11.200
You have been to such and such guru.” Then, your power to give him Realization.

00:45:11.200 --> 00:45:20.460
Also, later on, can be told and shown how you give Realization.

00:45:20.460 --> 00:45:23.040
You should say, “Now you try to give me Realization.”

00:45:23.040 --> 00:45:26.080
You say, “All right, you give me Realization.”

00:45:26.080 --> 00:45:29.275
If they say “I can’t”, “All right, I will give you.

00:45:29.275 --> 00:45:34.720
Will you allow me?” Supposing he accepts this, finished!

00:45:34.720 --> 00:45:41.280
Then he is finished now. Once he is Realized then he won’t talk.

00:45:41.280 --> 00:45:46.240
So, you have to be very understanding of the situation that first of all,

00:45:46.240 --> 00:45:48.320
you are a Realized soul, you have your own powers,

00:45:48.320 --> 00:45:53.840
the whole Divine is behind you. Don’t forget it. With all confidence,

00:45:53.840 --> 00:45:58.960
just face the person. First go into meditative mood,

00:45:59.680 --> 00:46:04.480
gather up all your powers and see that you raise his Kundalini.

00:46:04.480 --> 00:46:10.240
Bring him to some point of rapport. Then these points, one by one,

00:46:10.240 --> 00:46:14.280
as maybe you suggested, which they have suggested, are all right.

00:46:14.280 --> 00:46:19.440
But before raising them, discussion will lead to discussion.

00:46:19.440 --> 00:46:23.680
And it’s a headache to be with such people, I can do it

00:46:23.680 --> 00:46:28.480
because I don’t get a headache. But you people don’t do it.

00:46:29.760 --> 00:46:33.200
Have nothing to do with the people who cannot be brought

00:46:33.200 --> 00:46:44.000
to a certain level of understanding. And they themselves will be impressed

00:46:44.000 --> 00:46:49.901
by your personality, by your methods. In your quiet way, you should say,

00:46:49.901 --> 00:46:54.960
‘Ha, this is it, ha!’ – like that, go on saying, ‘Yes, yes.’

00:46:54.960 --> 00:46:58.240
So, he’ll thinks that he is impressing you, also you are listening to him,

00:46:58.240 --> 00:47:04.800
that also pleases them quite a lot. Then now, say, “All right. Let me see,

00:47:04.800 --> 00:47:07.833
let me see where is the Kundalini. Let me see”. See, go around him.

00:47:07.833 --> 00:47:10.075
“All right, all right. Now say what you have to say”, again say,

00:47:10.075 --> 00:47:19.280
”I want to hear”. And at the back, raise it.

00:47:19.280 --> 00:47:22.080
Because if you cannot take out something straightforward,

00:47:22.080 --> 00:47:26.960
means you have to put your finger in a roundabout way to take it out.

00:47:26.960 --> 00:47:29.760
Even then if the Kundalini doesn’t want to rise, we have nothing

00:47:29.760 --> 00:47:37.440
to do with such horrible people. So, first of all, you must judge

00:47:37.440 --> 00:47:44.720
the other person, raise his Kundalini, work it out and then, once he has got it,

00:47:44.720 --> 00:47:56.080
then we argue. All right, Ray? You know the technique. Second question.

00:47:56.080 --> 00:48:01.440
So, everyone whatever they have said, are correct points, and first class

00:48:01.440 --> 00:48:06.240
as he has said it, Warren, it’s very kind.

00:48:06.240 --> 00:48:12.880
And all these points must be brought in. But when you have brought them

00:48:12.880 --> 00:48:16.400
to a certain level of establishment. Otherwise they’ll be just nodding

00:48:16.400 --> 00:48:22.880
their heads or they will be denying you. It’s totally useless, because definitely

00:48:22.880 --> 00:48:34.400
you know your knowledge. Now, second question.

00:48:34.400 --> 00:48:39.440
Mother, You were saying that people who don’t accept their Realization,

00:48:39.440 --> 00:48:45.280
we should not bother with them. How do you relate to people around you

00:48:45.280 --> 00:48:50.880
who are loving and caring, nice people, but they just don’t understand

00:48:50.880 --> 00:48:54.000
and they don’t accept, probably they will not?

00:48:54.000 --> 00:48:59.920
I can’t hear, there was some noise.

00:48:59.920 --> 00:49:05.440
How do you relate to those closely around you who don’t accept Realization?

00:49:05.440 --> 00:49:06.480
How do you?

00:49:06.480 --> 00:49:07.440
But who are not negative.

00:49:07.440 --> 00:49:13.826
But who are not negative, but who just simply don’t understand?

00:49:13.826 --> 00:49:13.840
Normal people.

00:49:13.840 --> 00:49:30.640
They’re not of your level, you know. But as a person who is higher

00:49:30.640 --> 00:49:39.840
than others, you should be patronizing. And you should know they are still blind,

00:49:39.840 --> 00:49:43.360
they are ignorant, they haven’t got the knowledge, all right,

00:49:43.360 --> 00:49:54.372
they will get it. Keep it like that, position like that.

00:49:54.372 --> 00:49:59.829
Gradually they’ll come up. There is no need to talk of Sahaja Yoga

00:49:59.829 --> 00:50:05.910
with those people, but in your life only, in your way of life,

00:50:05.910 --> 00:50:07.862
they will understand, gradually they’ll come up.

00:50:07.862 --> 00:50:13.200
Maybe they are inadequate, perhaps, maybe, or maybe they are not seekers,

00:50:13.200 --> 00:50:17.600
or maybe their time has not yet come. You cannot force it out.

00:50:17.600 --> 00:50:22.320
My own daughters are not Realized, I’m not worried. They know I am

00:50:22.320 --> 00:50:28.383
something great, no doubt about it. And they think they are in trouble

00:50:28.383 --> 00:50:31.000
because of this thing. All right, whatever it is,

00:50:31.000 --> 00:50:34.720
let them be what they like. It’s all right, I am having a normal life

00:50:34.720 --> 00:50:41.760
with them. But your own life will convince them that you are right.

00:50:41.760 --> 00:50:46.640
And they might start respecting you very much. And after some time,

00:50:46.640 --> 00:50:51.482
not only respecting, but listening to you and then accepting Sahaja Yoga.

00:50:51.482 --> 00:50:58.285
There should be no quarrel with them. Sahaja Yoga is the most precious thing

00:50:58.285 --> 00:51:02.507
and you cannot waste it on anyone. You cannot. Christ has said,

00:51:02.507 --> 00:51:13.760
“Don’t throw your pearls before the horrible people”; that’s what it is.

00:51:13.760 --> 00:51:21.440
But those people who are around you, are there. These are your brothers

00:51:21.440 --> 00:51:27.600
and sisters, they speak your language. Just they are there, it’s all right,

00:51:27.600 --> 00:51:36.400
they will also get Realization, but they can’t speak your language.

00:51:38.160 --> 00:51:41.200
You may love them. Supposing we have a dog in the family –

00:51:41.200 --> 00:51:44.560
I’m not saying they are dogs but – but what I’m meaning is supposing

00:51:44.560 --> 00:51:46.800
we have a dog that doesn’t have the human awareness.

00:51:46.800 --> 00:51:51.840
We love the dog very much, no doubt, we look after the dog, all right,

00:51:51.840 --> 00:52:00.240
but we don’t talk to him. We don’t expect him to talk like us.

00:52:00.240 --> 00:52:03.600
So, the awareness is at that level. On the contrary, we have to be

00:52:03.600 --> 00:52:08.960
very patronizing and extremely kind. All right?

00:52:08.960 --> 00:52:13.040
Now, Kaya, can you answer this question and little elaborate it?

00:52:13.040 --> 00:52:16.880
Who should start it now? You see, with some people who had

00:52:16.880 --> 00:52:20.712
horrible experiences with the people who are around. So, I would like,

00:52:20.712 --> 00:52:26.240
request first of all you to speak, Warren.

00:52:26.240 --> 00:52:29.760
Well, I think we had one example this weekend at Robert’s home.

00:52:29.760 --> 00:52:32.720
His parents have gained their Realization, in fact.

00:52:32.720 --> 00:52:33.360
Really?

00:52:33.360 --> 00:52:34.720
Yes.

00:52:34.720 --> 00:52:35.600
From You.

00:52:35.600 --> 00:52:36.160
From You.

00:52:36.160 --> 00:52:39.760
Yes, yes, yes! Yes, I know.

00:52:39.760 --> 00:52:45.120
Absolutely sweet people, absolutely balanced people,

00:52:45.120 --> 00:52:50.080
in the sense in which society sees it as a whole, and yet they can’t see

00:52:50.080 --> 00:52:56.160
the depth that Robert can see. And they treated a little patronizingly,

00:52:56.160 --> 00:53:00.480
and: “There, there, it will be all right. You do it your way and we’ll do it

00:53:00.480 --> 00:53:04.800
our way”. Meanwhile they have their cigarettes and they entertain

00:53:04.800 --> 00:53:08.800
their guests and they have their lifestyle.

00:53:08.800 --> 00:53:15.920
But Robert’s determination was to set the example, to transform,

00:53:15.920 --> 00:53:22.320
to let them see by his transformation that Sahaja Yoga is it.

00:53:22.320 --> 00:53:29.760
When we were there, they behaved like – they became disturbed by the tranquillity

00:53:29.760 --> 00:53:35.200
that he was. They started rushing around and shouting, and giving orders

00:53:35.200 --> 00:53:38.080
and a few things, and then slowly they could see what is happening

00:53:38.080 --> 00:53:43.280
and they started to look at themselves. There was a little microcosm

00:53:43.280 --> 00:53:49.760
of the transformation actually over that weekend when we were with them.

00:53:49.760 --> 00:53:57.440
You can do it by transformation. And people start to watch and then

00:53:57.440 --> 00:54:01.440
instead of running around in circles getting nowhere, they start to say,

00:54:01.440 --> 00:54:04.085
“Ah, this is something great”.

00:54:04.085 --> 00:54:14.160
Very true. What did you say, Christine? It’s a difficult question for you.

00:54:14.160 --> 00:54:19.600
Well, there’s certainly no point in arguing about it or trying

00:54:19.600 --> 00:54:27.440
to discuss Sahaja Yoga beyond telling, if anybody asks, you can say

00:54:27.440 --> 00:54:31.200
how much good it’s done to you, how much you’re transformed.

00:54:31.200 --> 00:54:34.720
You can say many things, if people are interested.

00:54:34.720 --> 00:54:38.800
And if they are not, you can, you just live with them,

00:54:38.800 --> 00:54:43.040
you just be yourself. You enjoy yourself and they see you enjoying yourself

00:54:43.040 --> 00:54:46.400
much more than they’re enjoying themselves. And,

00:54:46.400 --> 00:54:51.520
“Hmm, what’s going on here?” Then they might become a little bit

00:54:51.520 --> 00:54:55.680
curious. But if they don’t, it doesn’t matter either.

00:54:55.680 --> 00:55:02.240
And really, unless somebody is seeking, unless they’re asking for it,

00:55:02.240 --> 00:55:08.160
then all we can do is be there. You know, just go about our business,

00:55:08.160 --> 00:55:13.360
do what has to be done and be perfectly normal.

00:55:13.360 --> 00:55:16.560
And I’ll go a little further. If you try to take interest

00:55:16.560 --> 00:55:19.920
in anyone like that, you’ll have very bad experiences.

00:55:19.920 --> 00:55:20.880
Oh, yes.

00:55:21.760 --> 00:55:24.320
Never good. Forget it!

00:55:24.320 --> 00:55:25.600
Yes.

00:55:25.600 --> 00:55:32.800
Yes, never to try because then you’ll really get caught up.

00:55:32.800 --> 00:55:37.840
All right, now, so, another question. Yes, please?

00:55:37.840 --> 00:55:41.860
Mother? I have a question now, besides all the questions.

00:55:41.860 --> 00:55:44.960
Alan, I can’t hear you. Stand up a little bit, yes.

00:55:44.960 --> 00:55:49.360
My sister, myself and Christopher, her husband, went to see my parents

00:55:49.360 --> 00:55:53.034
the other week and we had a rather appalling experience with them,

00:55:53.034 --> 00:55:56.400
which means they just went absolutely crazy, you know.

00:55:57.760 --> 00:56:04.400
And I was wondering what would you do in that situation, because when you

00:56:04.400 --> 00:56:12.400
can’t even get a word in, all you can do is sit there,

00:56:12.400 --> 00:56:20.160
what would you do in that situation? Because that I don’t know.

00:56:20.160 --> 00:56:25.200
Now they’re just entangling themselves you know.

00:56:29.200 --> 00:56:37.408
That’s it. That’s it. Pat can tell you. Pat will know.

00:56:37.408 --> 00:56:43.600
Is that parents, Mother?

00:56:43.600 --> 00:56:47.360
I mean, yes, we can tell you to ask you for some details, about these parents.

00:56:49.120 --> 00:56:57.040
Well, I got quite a lot of problems with my parents. To begin with,

00:56:57.040 --> 00:57:03.200
we were working to convert them, you know, and I wanted to…

00:57:03.200 --> 00:57:07.040
And we just – in our first puja, we just got carried away and we said,

00:57:07.040 --> 00:57:11.840
too much, too soon. You know, we just – in fact, it nearly worked

00:57:11.840 --> 00:57:16.720
because we were so enthusiastic. My father got Realization,

00:57:16.720 --> 00:57:21.600
he gave up drinking and he started saying the Catholic church had never really

00:57:21.600 --> 00:57:25.920
satisfied him and all this; and my mother panicked.

00:57:25.920 --> 00:57:30.240
And panicked, and there were discussions, and then he gave up.

00:57:30.240 --> 00:57:42.640
And went back to drinking and she was very happy.

00:57:43.600 --> 00:57:50.720
But we still didn’t give up hope. Before what we tended to get

00:57:50.720 --> 00:57:57.440
over-involved, I think. And you can get obsessed with it,

00:57:57.440 --> 00:58:04.240
because you are so close to them and in the end, I was getting

00:58:04.240 --> 00:58:09.200
very, very upset because my father – I mean, the situation I have with my son

00:58:09.200 --> 00:58:15.360
who is staying with my parents. And my father was behaving badly,

00:58:15.360 --> 00:58:20.320
he was taking it out on Kevin and I was getting really upset

00:58:20.320 --> 00:58:24.080
because I was trying to be nice with him all the time. And inside,

00:58:24.080 --> 00:58:30.880
I was getting furious. And, in the end, one day I was so upset because he’d been

00:58:31.600 --> 00:58:41.360
beating Kevin. And Mother said, “Look this is ridiculous,

00:58:41.360 --> 00:58:46.960
go and teach him a lesson. Go and get rid of his drinks”.

00:58:47.520 --> 00:58:54.560
So, I went home and got all his bottles, and poured them down the sink.

00:58:54.560 --> 00:59:07.280
And they were horrified. But it made the brake, you know.

00:59:07.920 --> 00:59:11.112
Afterwards my father said he quite respected me for what I had done,

00:59:11.112 --> 00:59:15.280
even if he didn’t know why. But since them,

00:59:15.280 --> 00:59:20.823
I have been more detached. Do you have children?

00:59:35.823 --> 00:59:37.840
But, you see – first, if you had asked him this

00:59:37.840 --> 00:59:42.560
about four years back, he was very serious

00:59:42.560 --> 00:59:45.920
and he used to feel it too much, you see, “My father”, every time he used to say,

00:59:45.920 --> 00:59:50.473
“Mother, see, my father drinks, gone case. My mother is like that”.

00:59:50.473 --> 00:59:55.720
In the morning he would be all so upset, he would come out with such an expression,

00:59:55.720 --> 01:00:01.600
you see, absolutely disgusted. But now, you see, they are taking it

01:00:01.600 --> 01:00:04.800
very easily, I mean, it’s all right, it’s a joke for them,

01:00:04.800 --> 01:00:11.600
now it’s nothing so disgusting or, I mean, sort of so comparing

01:00:11.600 --> 01:00:14.800
that they would feel that their Realization is useless

01:00:14.800 --> 01:00:18.080
because their father is drinking, the mother – you see, your relationship

01:00:18.080 --> 01:00:22.400
is with God, main thing. And those who are related to God

01:00:22.400 --> 01:00:26.240
are your relations, really. Others are just – by the way

01:00:26.240 --> 01:00:29.918
they are there, all right, but then they started enjoying it,

01:00:29.918 --> 01:00:33.600
I mean, they never were so upset as they were before.

01:00:33.600 --> 01:00:36.400
This is what happens as you start growing.

01:00:36.400 --> 01:00:40.346
There’s also a very subtle ego sometimes involved, because…

01:00:40.346 --> 01:00:41.409
You think, eh?

01:00:41.409 --> 01:00:44.640
If we can’t change them.

01:00:44.640 --> 01:00:47.280
That’s true, it’s true.

01:00:47.280 --> 01:00:51.760
We get a bit upset and that translates into a sort of caring attitude

01:00:51.760 --> 01:00:54.285
which is of course is very false.

01:00:54.285 --> 01:00:54.959
Yes, it’s true. Yes?

01:00:58.328 --> 01:01:02.400
The thing is, Mother, if we haven’t spoken to our parents

01:01:02.400 --> 01:01:07.280
or told them about Sahaja Yoga, yet they immediately condemn you,

01:01:07.280 --> 01:01:11.360
and every time you walk through the door, they scream at you, and shout at you,

01:01:11.360 --> 01:01:15.440
and you are trying to love them. And whatever you’re doing, I mean,

01:01:15.440 --> 01:01:18.560
I’m not trying to throw them in Sahaja Yoga or anything.

01:01:18.560 --> 01:01:22.640
It’s just they scream for no reason. It’s strange.

01:01:22.640 --> 01:01:23.760
Witnessing.

01:01:23.760 --> 01:01:31.440
Ask them what’s wrong with them. You shouldn’t share this [inaudible].

01:01:34.720 --> 01:01:41.840
No, but you see, it is also sometimes there is a bhoot, they react like that.

01:01:41.840 --> 01:01:44.074
Yes.

01:01:44.074 --> 01:01:48.920
It is so. John will tell you, there was a fellow who was running a –

01:01:48.920 --> 01:01:54.880
your friend, John, was running that, a big store or something.

01:01:54.880 --> 01:01:58.360
And he went with him in the car and he was a Raktabija disciple.

01:01:58.360 --> 01:02:00.480
Do you remember, he went amuck?

01:02:00.480 --> 01:02:01.462
Yes, Mother.

01:02:02.160 --> 01:02:05.920
And poor John, you know, he wanted to jump out of his car

01:02:05.920 --> 01:02:15.040
because he just went amuck in his presence. Just went amuck.

01:02:15.040 --> 01:02:20.480
Now, so, what is the next question?

01:02:20.480 --> 01:02:31.639
I have a question, Mother. … my mother for instance

01:02:40.560 --> 01:02:52.000
would like to come and meet You… She’s has been quite interested

01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:58.960
and a friend of mine… But a friend of mine is interested

01:02:58.960 --> 01:03:02.320
in seeing You. So, I happen to have an effect on people.

01:03:02.320 --> 01:03:06.800
But sometimes it ends up very sincere seekers, another,

01:03:06.800 --> 01:03:11.040
my mother’s friend, I gave her your picture, she’s very sincere.

01:03:11.040 --> 01:03:16.560
Sometimes I’m not sure exactly how to talk about it, how to initiate it,

01:03:16.560 --> 01:03:21.680
how to bring it up, and I know that all these people are really seeking,

01:03:21.680 --> 01:03:28.640
they are not low-quality people. Sometimes I feel instead of watering it,

01:03:28.640 --> 01:03:35.600
I’m forcing it down their throats. And I would like to have them come

01:03:35.600 --> 01:03:38.101
to the centre, where they could meet some of the older people.

01:03:38.101 --> 01:03:39.087
It’s a good idea.

01:03:39.087 --> 01:03:44.160
My parents for instance, although they profess to be against this,

01:03:44.160 --> 01:03:47.040
they’ve been very sweet, they’ve helped me to come here,

01:03:47.040 --> 01:03:52.000
they have an attraction towards it, and despite what they say,

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:55.280
they’ve been helping me. I guess because they see the work,

01:03:55.280 --> 01:03:56.960
the change.

01:03:56.960 --> 01:03:59.440
Well, you should not be involved. The point is, you see,

01:03:59.440 --> 01:04:02.000
whatever you desire is good, but you should not get involved

01:04:02.000 --> 01:04:04.720
with their desire. Your desire is a good idea.

01:04:04.720 --> 01:04:07.360
Because it should work out, after all, you are their near and dear,

01:04:07.360 --> 01:04:10.480
you can influence them the most. It will work out also.

01:04:10.480 --> 01:04:13.120
But if you think that you can get involved into it,

01:04:13.120 --> 01:04:17.760
either you’ll play into ego or superego. You should not get involved with people

01:04:17.760 --> 01:04:28.720
who are not themselves seeking. That’s the point. What else?

01:04:41.760 --> 01:04:44.560
Mother, one question which always comes up,

01:04:44.560 --> 01:04:50.720
it’s about You, Mother. While they are experiencing this:

01:04:52.240 --> 01:04:58.000
“Who is this Mataji who is causing the experience?”. And it’s always

01:04:58.000 --> 01:04:59.360
difficult, you know.

01:04:59.360 --> 01:05:03.920
No, but do not talk about Me for the time being. You see, even then

01:05:03.920 --> 01:05:08.880
to talk about Me or not makes no difference to Me, isn’t it?

01:05:08.880 --> 01:05:12.800
Let them come up, gradually themselves they will know. You should say,

01:05:12.800 --> 01:05:15.840
“Must be someone, that’s all. Now, you’d better guess”,

01:05:15.840 --> 01:05:19.040
you leave it to them. You need not say anything to them.

01:05:19.040 --> 01:05:21.280
That’s one thing I warned always, from the very beginning,

01:05:21.280 --> 01:05:24.400
it’s too much to bear for people, you see?

01:05:24.400 --> 01:05:27.760
You should say, “There must be something about Her, we don’t know”.

01:05:27.760 --> 01:05:32.960
But it is too much – because, you see, if you tell them that I am such and such,

01:05:32.960 --> 01:05:40.160
either they’ll be finished with fear or they’ll be on top of this, you see.

01:05:40.160 --> 01:05:42.720
So, the best thing is not to tell; these things are not to be told.

01:05:42.720 --> 01:05:45.920
That’s what I’ve told you, that in this lifetime I’ve decided

01:05:45.920 --> 01:05:50.560
not to talk about it to anyone, till they are Realized souls –

01:05:50.560 --> 01:05:58.400
well settled. Even in that book, you have written that Sahasrara

01:05:58.400 --> 01:06:01.276
is ‘Jai Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi’. Please do not write.

01:06:01.276 --> 01:06:09.440
You should write there ‘Adi Shakti’, that’s better. Because after all,

01:06:09.440 --> 01:06:12.640
I know that one should not worry about all these things,

01:06:12.640 --> 01:06:16.160
because this I’m telling the Deities, you see. And that, “One should tell it,

01:06:16.160 --> 01:06:18.800
and I must say what is the truth is, and all that.

01:06:18.800 --> 01:06:21.240
And I should not waste time”. And I understand that.

01:06:21.240 --> 01:06:26.800
But why I am saying this? That these people are very delicately

01:06:26.800 --> 01:06:30.240
placed, they are ignorant and just because of this,

01:06:30.240 --> 01:06:33.680
if there are going to be shattered, it’s better not to tell them.

01:06:33.680 --> 01:06:39.120
So, for puja also we don’t have all of them there. Very few people

01:06:39.120 --> 01:06:44.400
should be allowed to come to puja. All half-baked people should be really

01:06:44.400 --> 01:06:49.120
kept away. They should not be told what I am, nothing of the kind.

01:06:49.120 --> 01:06:53.360
In Gregoire’s book, that’s the mistake he committed, I think, because he put

01:06:53.360 --> 01:07:00.720
Rajneesh there and said that I had said so and so. And I couldn’t take it.

01:07:00.720 --> 01:07:03.760
There’s no need to say. By saying that, what do you achieve?

01:07:03.760 --> 01:07:08.800
Or what do I achieve? Whatever I am, I am.

01:07:08.800 --> 01:07:12.720
But Mother, You’ve achieved a lot that night, you said in a very

01:07:12.720 --> 01:07:17.040
scolding nature that question, “You’ve got to recognize Me”.

01:07:17.040 --> 01:07:18.780
And that achieved a tremendous…

01:07:18.780 --> 01:07:20.800
When did I say that?

01:07:20.800 --> 01:07:21.600
At Hampstead.

01:07:21.600 --> 01:07:22.240
Eh?

01:07:22.240 --> 01:07:23.415
At Hampstead.

01:07:23.415 --> 01:07:23.430
At Caxton Hall.

01:07:23.430 --> 01:07:28.640
At Caxton Hall, sorry, I beg your pardon, yes.

01:07:28.640 --> 01:07:33.360
And that blasted them up.

01:07:33.360 --> 01:07:37.760
But you see, I weigh the timings properly.

01:07:37.760 --> 01:07:38.480
Yes.

01:07:38.480 --> 01:07:40.000
At the right time I say it.

01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:40.560
Of course.

01:07:40.560 --> 01:07:44.640
Yes. But you have made a mistake that time. So, I would say that

01:07:44.640 --> 01:07:48.160
better avoid saying about Me.

01:07:48.160 --> 01:07:49.960
You said it anyway, Mother, it was not they.

01:07:49.960 --> 01:07:55.230
But see, was the first time I might have said it in that way.

01:07:55.230 --> 01:07:58.197
But you see, most of them were Sahaja Yogis, there were very few people

01:07:58.197 --> 01:08:04.560
who must have come, new people, then I had to say that.

01:08:04.560 --> 01:08:12.960
But, normally, you should not say, though it’s true, very true.

01:08:12.960 --> 01:08:18.880
This is the only condition you have. If you cannot recognize Me,

01:08:18.880 --> 01:08:24.080
nothing can work out. It’s perfectly true, I agree, I accept,

01:08:24.080 --> 01:08:29.440
it’s a fact, that’s what they have put it up. That has to be.

01:08:29.440 --> 01:08:36.560
Now, I’ll tell you, say, this lady who was there, Peggy, and my foot,

01:08:36.560 --> 01:08:41.040
you see, just went like this. It was so painful; I could not put it

01:08:41.040 --> 01:08:43.996
on the ground. Both put especially this one [right foot].

01:08:43.996 --> 01:08:46.000
And I asked Gavin, I said, “I don’t know what’s happening

01:08:46.000 --> 01:08:49.360
with Peggy and all, this foot won’t allow Me even to stand”. It would not!

01:08:49.360 --> 01:08:54.240
All the Deities were angry with Me. And they were just going on and on

01:08:54.240 --> 01:08:58.880
emitting such vibrations, tremendous vibrations.

01:08:58.880 --> 01:09:01.840
I didn’t – I asked Gavin, ”Take out the vibrations, soothe them,

01:09:01.840 --> 01:09:08.720
soothe them, you soothe them”. See, they don’t listen.

01:09:08.720 --> 01:09:13.600
She told Me that, “Mother, I just put your photograph in this village”.

01:09:13.600 --> 01:09:18.160
And the whole place was flooded by the river. And the river washed

01:09:18.160 --> 01:09:24.800
all our bedrooms, bathrooms, everything. Three inches water came in,

01:09:24.800 --> 01:09:28.480
it washed all of us. The people who were doing fraud

01:09:28.480 --> 01:09:31.760
or something were caught up and all kinds of things happened.

01:09:31.760 --> 01:09:39.600
In that, in those three weeks only, she said there was a real spring cleaning.

01:09:39.600 --> 01:09:42.640
She told Me this. But this you need not tell others, you see,

01:09:42.640 --> 01:09:45.840
because they won’t understand you. So, no use telling them, you see,

01:09:45.840 --> 01:09:49.440
those who do not understand, what’s the use of talking to them

01:09:49.440 --> 01:09:52.560
and wasting your energy? It’s unnecessary.

01:09:52.560 --> 01:09:59.040
It’s unnecessary, I tell you, it has no meaning, believe Me.

01:09:59.040 --> 01:10:02.080
A general point, Mother, that when people first get Realization

01:10:02.080 --> 01:10:06.800
they are full of enthusiasm, but they can only express itself

01:10:06.800 --> 01:10:12.240
through the old channels. So, they want to talk about You

01:10:12.240 --> 01:10:16.160
and they want those who are close to them to come to Sahaja Yoga,

01:10:16.160 --> 01:10:23.440
or to accept them in a new place, in a new style, but they don’t have

01:10:23.440 --> 01:10:28.320
the capacity to achieve this using the vibrations.

01:10:28.320 --> 01:10:34.000
Because that capacity hasn’t yet developed. So that this is why

01:10:34.000 --> 01:10:39.600
so many of us had trouble at first of integrating our new experience

01:10:39.600 --> 01:10:44.880
into our own life without staying in our old lifestyle ourselves.

01:10:45.840 --> 01:10:53.120
So I think, when people get these urges to rush out and convert everybody,

01:10:53.120 --> 01:10:58.480
they have to question where that is coming from, within themselves.

01:10:58.480 --> 01:11:01.120
Because in a way, when we are subtle…

01:11:01.120 --> 01:11:06.560
Doing that also you should be careful with the ego. Because in this country,

01:11:06.560 --> 01:11:11.920
I told you ego is in front of the nose, you see, like that,

01:11:11.920 --> 01:11:13.040
you have to be very careful.

01:11:13.040 --> 01:11:16.040
It’s only when we know You that we understand how many forms

01:11:16.040 --> 01:11:18.640
that You can take, Mother.

01:11:18.640 --> 01:11:20.720
That’s true, not everyone.

01:11:20.720 --> 01:11:24.480
Then we have to ask You to do the job, and then it works.

01:11:24.480 --> 01:11:28.080
No, I know you have asked many people, I know that you ask them

01:11:28.080 --> 01:11:31.920
that you ask Mother, “if you are so, if you are so, if you are so”.

01:11:31.920 --> 01:11:36.080
All right. But you have certain sense of deference about it.

01:11:36.080 --> 01:11:39.120
That all of us should have. Of course, I mean sometimes

01:11:39.120 --> 01:11:42.200
you have to do it because especially in India where they worship

01:11:42.200 --> 01:11:47.578
all these Shivas, this and this, then you have to ask them to ask,

01:11:47.578 --> 01:11:50.560
“Are you Shiva?”. But there they readily accept and ask, because they know

01:11:50.560 --> 01:11:54.080
that Shakti is higher than anything else. So they don’t mind.

01:11:54.080 --> 01:11:58.800
But here, a woman herself is very low and then all Gods and Goddesses

01:11:58.800 --> 01:12:03.600
are much above, so: “Who is She?”. So here, because the ego is just

01:12:03.600 --> 01:12:07.280
in front of the nose, like that you see, it’s better to be careful.

01:12:07.920 --> 01:12:12.720
That’s what I am saying. But sometimes you have to say.

01:12:12.720 --> 01:12:17.920
But I am rather worried because apart from that, you may lose them,

01:12:17.920 --> 01:12:22.640
even you may lose your tooth, it may happen for saying like that,

01:12:22.640 --> 01:12:28.320
you see. People are extremely violent and their violence may not be

01:12:28.320 --> 01:12:33.040
so much physical, but mentally they are very violent people.

01:12:33.040 --> 01:12:40.000
And they say all kinds of things which you may not be able to bear, even.

01:12:40.000 --> 01:12:44.080
What I am saying, Mother, you have to ask Shri Hanumana and Shri Bhairava

01:12:44.080 --> 01:12:47.920
to do the job, rather than trying to think, one can do it oneself.

01:12:47.920 --> 01:12:49.342
You yourself have to ask, all right.

01:12:49.342 --> 01:12:51.920
We have, we have, that’s right, yes.

01:12:51.920 --> 01:12:54.480
But you need not tell the other person.

01:12:54.480 --> 01:12:58.544
You can’t tell the other person anything about it, but you ask

01:12:58.544 --> 01:13:03.064
the Deities to handle a situation, so that they get sort it out.

01:13:03.064 --> 01:13:05.394
They manage the show. But they can sometimes manage the show, you see,

01:13:05.394 --> 01:13:07.173
they are all … Like, in the case of Peggy,

01:13:07.173 --> 01:13:08.773
you should have seen Gavin’s face.&nbsp;

01:13:13.600 --> 01:13:15.680
How it was managed so well, you see,

01:13:15.680 --> 01:13:21.520
she was so stupid you can’t imagine! That she just started talking like that.

01:13:21.520 --> 01:13:26.000
But it’s all managed, I agree. But sometimes, they also manage it

01:13:26.000 --> 01:13:32.000
so well. Then you feel, “Baba, now don’t manage it, let us do it”.

01:13:32.000 --> 01:13:39.120
On the whole, on the whole, we must know that our job is to save.

01:13:39.120 --> 01:13:46.080
With patience, with understanding. Whether we convince them mentally

01:13:46.080 --> 01:13:52.080
or not is not the point. How many people we save, is the point.

01:13:52.080 --> 01:13:55.040
This is absolutely the essence of Sahaja Yoga.

01:13:55.040 --> 01:14:01.520
How many people on this Earth we save. That’s the only thing we have to

01:14:01.520 --> 01:14:05.120
look after. Whether mentally you satisfy somebody or not, whether –

01:14:05.120 --> 01:14:09.920
that’s not important, you see? How many people you are going to save,

01:14:09.920 --> 01:14:16.400
that’s all. Whether they are Indians, Americans, Australians,

01:14:16.400 --> 01:14:22.240
makes no difference. These identifications are also there,

01:14:22.240 --> 01:14:26.880
you see, that English must save English, you see, while they drown each other

01:14:26.880 --> 01:14:31.080
very well. But still, it is so! Australians must save Australians.

01:14:31.080 --> 01:14:40.800
The true form here comes in, as Marie said, it’s true. French!

01:14:40.800 --> 01:14:44.400
But it is not our lookout. What we have to do,

01:14:44.400 --> 01:14:53.760
how many human beings we are going to save. And don’t get after anyone

01:14:53.760 --> 01:14:57.920
who is difficult, forget it! We have to get more people.

01:14:57.920 --> 01:15:00.720
So if you run after one person you definitely waste your energy

01:15:00.720 --> 01:15:04.960
on one person. Instead of that, why not get to ten good people,

01:15:04.960 --> 01:15:11.920
simple people and work it out? All right?

01:15:11.920 --> 01:15:16.800
Now, what about you, have you any question, Brian?

01:15:16.800 --> 01:15:21.760
Earlier on, Mother, you were talking about not wasting energy on people

01:15:21.760 --> 01:15:28.080
who have been in Sahaja Yoga for some time but who are half-baked,

01:15:28.080 --> 01:15:36.560
and so on. What is the criteria? How are judgements made?

01:15:36.560 --> 01:15:42.880
How does one or a group of people decide that an individual should be left alone

01:15:42.880 --> 01:15:45.600
or not? Can you encourage that?

01:15:45.600 --> 01:15:49.280
No, there’s no need to have a group of people, you can know.

01:15:49.280 --> 01:15:51.920
You see, the way they start talking, you know. When they talk you feel

01:15:51.920 --> 01:15:56.255
somebody is talking through their hat. You can make out.

01:15:56.255 --> 01:15:58.720
I mean, we can make out a lunatic, can’t we? You see,

01:15:58.720 --> 01:16:02.080
they start talking like that. Their style of talking,

01:16:02.080 --> 01:16:05.760
they’ll criticize Sahaja Yogis, they’ll criticize Sahaja Yoga,

01:16:05.760 --> 01:16:09.760
this is the style of a negative personality. They’ll do all these things,

01:16:09.760 --> 01:16:14.074
you see, then you will know that they are the ones.

01:16:20.074 --> 01:16:23.920
Their style of talking you can make out, the way they live.

01:16:23.920 --> 01:16:28.640
Like this Peggy went to India, in Puna, she got after some man.

01:16:28.640 --> 01:16:35.840
And then she was crawling as he said, in the hall just like a snake, you see.

01:16:35.840 --> 01:16:37.920
And people asked her, “What are you doing?” and she said,

01:16:37.920 --> 01:16:43.680
“I’m giving exercise to my Kundalini”. I mean, now you know,

01:16:43.680 --> 01:16:51.200
this is a stupid woman, you see. We don’t have show-offs in Sahaja Yoga.

01:16:51.200 --> 01:16:53.600
Quarrelling people, all these are negative people. To quarrel,

01:16:53.600 --> 01:16:58.080
for Sahaja Yogis, it’s too much. All this is negative.

01:16:58.080 --> 01:17:03.622
Insulting people, these are all negative people.

01:17:09.200 --> 01:17:13.520
It’s not difficult to make out, it’s very simple.

01:17:13.520 --> 01:17:19.000
Among hundred people, there would be only one or two like that, at the most,

01:17:19.000 --> 01:17:23.836
at the most. Say, in the whole of England we found only Peggy like that.

01:17:23.836 --> 01:17:32.760
Ask Gavin, even the name shoots him off.&nbsp;

01:17:42.560 --> 01:17:43.200
Yes, yes.

01:17:43.200 --> 01:17:47.040
Mother, what should we say to people who say that Sahaja Yogis

01:17:47.040 --> 01:17:50.320
are self-righteous and so on, because we only seem to care

01:17:50.320 --> 01:17:52.160
about very few people?

01:17:52.160 --> 01:17:56.800
Let them say. You see, their certificate is not going to matter much with God.

01:17:56.800 --> 01:18:01.600
We are righteous people; we are righteous no doubt, and we are willing to save

01:18:01.600 --> 01:18:07.200
others who want to become righteous. No doubt about it. Why should we worry,

01:18:07.200 --> 01:18:09.520
you see, for the certificate of the people?

01:18:09.520 --> 01:18:13.440
We are not politicians; we are not seeking votes.

01:18:13.440 --> 01:18:21.040
We have to do the desire of God. We have to work for what God wants us

01:18:21.040 --> 01:18:25.680
to do. In that case, you see, we have to – of course with dignity,

01:18:25.680 --> 01:18:28.720
with compassion, with love, with affection it will be done,

01:18:28.720 --> 01:18:32.920
no doubt about it. But all these qualities for what?

01:18:32.920 --> 01:18:38.240
For saving people. If, by all these qualities, you cannot save someone,

01:18:38.240 --> 01:18:42.860
better forget it. Whether they call you righteous or not,

01:18:42.860 --> 01:18:47.360
it doesn’t matter. Their certificate is of no use to us.

01:18:47.360 --> 01:18:50.480
Their certificate is like the certificate of the Pope, you see, when you are going

01:18:50.480 --> 01:18:53.680
to have and he gives you a certificate. Who cares, you see?

01:18:53.680 --> 01:18:56.147
God doesn’t care for people who are not Sahaja Yogis.

01:18:56.147 --> 01:19:03.440
He doesn’t care for their certificate, because He has to care about you.

01:19:03.440 --> 01:19:07.440
It’s not important but that doesn’t mean that we should be arrogant,

01:19:07.440 --> 01:19:12.800
we should be unkind. But with some people, you have to be.

01:19:12.800 --> 01:19:16.160
Mother, there is a point there that the question has been asked to me

01:19:16.160 --> 01:19:24.720
before. About specific people saying that there are people in Sahaja Yoga

01:19:24.720 --> 01:19:29.600
who are dogmatic and who use Sahaja Yoga as something to clean on”.

01:19:29.600 --> 01:19:35.600
And those people being quite obvious, so something had to be said.

01:19:35.600 --> 01:19:40.657
I could not say, “It’s not true” because it’s quite obvious.

01:19:40.657 --> 01:19:41.680
No, I don’t think so.

01:19:41.680 --> 01:19:45.920
So, all you have to say, or all I could find to say in such cases,

01:19:45.920 --> 01:19:51.760
is that Sahaja Yogis are on their way too, they are progressing,

01:19:51.760 --> 01:19:53.866
but you can’t expect us to be perfect already.

01:19:53.866 --> 01:19:56.757
No, no, no, who are they to judge Sahaja Yogis? What I am saying,

01:19:56.757 --> 01:19:59.012
why should you give them so much importance?

01:19:59.012 --> 01:20:02.720
Who are they to judge Sahaja Yogis? They are not our own.

01:20:02.720 --> 01:20:05.152
You should not allow anybody to criticize sahaja yogis.

01:20:05.152 --> 01:20:07.760
That’s one thing and a principle of Sahaja Yoga.

01:20:07.760 --> 01:20:11.120
I know there are some little less, little more, all right.

01:20:11.120 --> 01:20:14.320
But nobody outsider can criticize Sahaja Yogis in the presence

01:20:14.320 --> 01:20:18.160
of a Sahaja Yogi. Nothing. They are Realized souls.

01:20:18.160 --> 01:20:22.240
They are of our level. Those people who are not of our level

01:20:22.240 --> 01:20:26.720
cannot criticize us. And we should never accept any criticism

01:20:26.720 --> 01:20:31.600
from anyone about any other Sahaja Yogi. Among ourselves, we can discuss.

01:20:31.600 --> 01:20:35.349
Not from who are outside, after all they are not Realized souls.

01:20:35.349 --> 01:20:38.717
You see, you must know you are a Realized soul, you are saints!

01:20:38.717 --> 01:20:41.520
do you understand? A saint has to respect the saints.

01:20:41.520 --> 01:20:43.600
I’ve seen many Sahaja Yogis are like that,

01:20:43.600 --> 01:20:48.320
who respect other people. Regis, for example, he used to respect

01:20:48.320 --> 01:20:53.760
other people more than the Sahaja Yogis. It’s a very common thing about him.

01:20:53.760 --> 01:20:57.800
And Chaya was so surprised at him. She said, “How do you respects others?”.

01:20:57.800 --> 01:21:04.160
“Oh, he’s such a big man!”. He may be, but in the eyes of God, sahaja yogis.

01:21:04.160 --> 01:21:08.800
She couldn’t understand, she couldn’t explain.

01:21:08.800 --> 01:21:12.400
You are all saints, and how can saints be judged by other people

01:21:12.400 --> 01:21:14.597
who are not saints? They have no business!

01:21:14.597 --> 01:21:19.090
You tell them, “You shut up! You have nothing to say.

01:21:19.090 --> 01:21:23.160
First get your realization”. So, I never allowed that because you are

01:21:23.160 --> 01:21:26.000
Realized souls after all, you must know you are Realized souls,

01:21:26.000 --> 01:21:30.400
and that your capacity is very different from the capacity of these people,

01:21:30.400 --> 01:21:33.680
mundane people who go on criticizing, “He’s like this, he’s like that”.

01:21:33.680 --> 01:21:38.800
How can you understand? How can you understand from that level?

01:21:38.800 --> 01:21:42.240
If you go and see, say, Gagangarh Maharaj,

01:21:42.240 --> 01:21:46.640
you might say he is a very hot-tempered fellow, he’s like this, he’s like that,

01:21:46.640 --> 01:21:51.680
and he can be very cruel. You can say about him,

01:21:51.680 --> 01:21:55.120
but when you see his vibrations you know he is not so.

01:21:55.120 --> 01:21:59.040
When I would go to see him, they told Me that, “Mother, you never go

01:21:59.040 --> 01:22:02.080
and see any guru, why do you want to see him?” I said, “All right,

01:22:02.080 --> 01:22:04.039
now you don’t discuss with Me, just put your hands

01:22:04.039 --> 01:22:08.640
towards his photograph. And we had to climb about seven miles up,

01:22:08.640 --> 01:22:12.320
and the vibrations started coming. I said, “Now, that’s it.”

01:22:12.320 --> 01:22:17.440
Whether he has a proper body or not, whether he has proper clothes or not,

01:22:17.440 --> 01:22:21.760
whether he lives in a palace or on the street, makes no difference

01:22:21.760 --> 01:22:25.520
to a Sahaja Yogi. If he is a Sahaja Yogi, he is a Sahaja Yogi, he’s my brother,

01:22:25.520 --> 01:22:31.120
he’s my sister. This is the thing which was – in everyone has to happen,

01:22:31.120 --> 01:22:37.598
you see? And this misidentification also leads to trouble. And, you see,

01:22:37.598 --> 01:22:40.480
the outside people, who are not Sahaja Yogis, make effort,

01:22:40.480 --> 01:22:44.080
I have seen people. I know, because I have a double life, I know

01:22:44.080 --> 01:22:49.360
how people create an impression: “Oh, please come in, please sit down,

01:22:49.360 --> 01:22:53.440
how, don’t disturb, this here…” That’s all,

01:22:53.440 --> 01:22:58.000
it is nothing deeper than that! But those who are deep people

01:22:58.000 --> 01:23:01.360
must realize the value of other deep people, because they are

01:23:01.360 --> 01:23:04.080
the only ones who understand you and you understand them.

01:23:04.080 --> 01:23:07.440
This is one of the reasons why there are rifts among Sahaja Yogis.

01:23:07.440 --> 01:23:11.920
They don’t respect each other. Once somebody is a Realized soul,

01:23:11.920 --> 01:23:15.840
he is to be respected as a saint, no doubt about it. I respect them

01:23:15.840 --> 01:23:26.830
as saints. If I have to judge relatively from me to you – say for example –

01:23:26.830 --> 01:23:29.680
they’ll be sitting here, I should be sitting there perhaps,

01:23:29.680 --> 01:23:37.280
maybe outside. But you are saints, you see, and saints have to be respected,

01:23:37.280 --> 01:23:44.320
you are saints. The whole world respects, every flower, every leaf, every wave

01:23:44.320 --> 01:23:51.360
of the ocean respects a saint. You must assume yourself as saints.

01:23:51.360 --> 01:23:54.000
Saints are saints, after all, it doesn’t matter little bit here

01:23:54.000 --> 01:23:58.400
and there. Yes, what is it?

01:23:58.400 --> 01:24:03.360
Also, the situation in the ashrams, Mother. If we have people living there

01:24:03.360 --> 01:24:07.360
who frankly just don’t get mixed together. And who don’t improve

01:24:07.360 --> 01:24:14.080
themselves [inaudible] what can we do with him? Should the ashrams fulfil

01:24:14.080 --> 01:24:17.756
a sort of role, one that’s a sort of…?

01:24:17.756 --> 01:24:21.120
No, no, it’s not a convenience, well, I must say it’s not a convenience.

01:24:21.120 --> 01:24:25.920
Ashram is a place for disciplining yourself, for perfecting yourself.

01:24:25.920 --> 01:24:30.720
As I said that your relation to yourself should be of perfection, because this is

01:24:30.720 --> 01:24:32.800
what you have to offer to God.

01:24:32.800 --> 01:24:35.840
And ashram is a place where you have to perfect yourself.

01:24:35.840 --> 01:24:38.800
If there are people like that, you should ask them to get out.

01:24:38.800 --> 01:24:42.240
Ashram is not a place where – absolutely you should ask them.

01:24:42.240 --> 01:24:45.120
It’s not a place of convenience. If you have to live there,

01:24:45.120 --> 01:24:49.520
you have to live with the rules and regulations whatever the ashram

01:24:49.520 --> 01:24:54.269
has formed so far. I’ve seen all of them. And those who do not want to do it

01:24:54.269 --> 01:24:55.360
should get out of it.

01:24:55.672 --> 01:25:00.345
Thank you, Mother.

01:25:00.348 --> 01:25:04.390
Ashram is not a place of any convenience. Many people say, “It’s very cheap

01:25:04.390 --> 01:25:08.480
you know, ashram, come along”, from everywhere they want to come down now

01:25:08.480 --> 01:25:14.560
and settle in ashram. That’s not so. Ashram is cheap but it’s very difficult.

01:25:14.560 --> 01:25:19.680
Those who want to perfect themselves have to come to ashram.

01:25:19.680 --> 01:25:23.600
Those who do not want should not come. If they are so comfortable otherwise,

01:25:23.600 --> 01:25:27.120
it’s all right, don’t make others have problems out of it,

01:25:27.120 --> 01:25:38.800
it’s absolutely simple as that. In addition to that, one must know

01:25:38.800 --> 01:25:42.480
the person who is made in charge, he may be not up to the mark,

01:25:42.480 --> 01:25:45.280
whatever it is, but through him I can act.

01:25:45.280 --> 01:25:49.760
I cannot act through all of you. So, you should not challenge

01:25:49.760 --> 01:25:54.000
the authority of the person who is appointed. If I find him useless,

01:25:54.000 --> 01:25:57.360
I’ll throw him away. But you don’t start every time,

01:25:57.360 --> 01:26:13.959
like Martin Luther. Disciplining is the point there,

01:26:13.959 --> 01:26:18.080
perfecting yourself. You see, the first thing I told you, your attitude

01:26:18.080 --> 01:26:24.000
should be towards yourself of perfection. Relationship should be ideal,

01:26:24.000 --> 01:26:27.210
like a Sahaja Yogi with a Sahaja Yogi. What should be your relationship

01:26:27.210 --> 01:26:32.480
with a Sahaja Yogi? He is your kith and kin, he is your own!

01:26:32.480 --> 01:26:39.360
How can you bear any malice against him?

01:26:39.360 --> 01:26:40.633
We should be self-disciplined, Mother.

01:26:40.633 --> 01:26:40.924
Hem?

01:26:40.924 --> 01:26:42.143
We should be self-disciplined ourselves.

01:26:42.143 --> 01:26:43.200
What’s it?

01:26:43.200 --> 01:26:46.880
It shouldn’t be an imposed discipline within the ashram, it should be,

01:26:46.880 --> 01:26:51.040
each individual should be self-disciplined.

01:26:51.040 --> 01:26:56.880
If that is the case, come in there. But if we leave it to that, I tell you:

01:26:56.880 --> 01:27:00.080
it won’t work out. First, it is to be forced.

01:27:00.080 --> 01:27:04.400
What we found in Australia, Mother, it perhaps, maybe not an example

01:27:04.400 --> 01:27:09.360
that can be translated into Britain, but we found that by being strict

01:27:09.360 --> 01:27:15.600
at first, then the strictness recedes and they become self-disciplined.

01:27:15.600 --> 01:27:19.181
There’s a very nice shloka in Sanskrit which I’ll say to you:

01:27:19.181 --> 01:27:22.589
“Pancha varshani tadayet dasha varshani partet

01:27:22.589 --> 01:27:27.280
shodashe varshe prapte tu putram mitravad acharet”.

01:27:27.280 --> 01:27:34.862
For five years of age, you beat the child, “tadayet”,

01:27:34.862 --> 01:27:41.885
chisel him out, that is ashram. Dasha varshani prapte tu partet”,

01:27:41.885 --> 01:27:48.000
then educate, for till ten years of age. “Shodashe varshe prapte tu”,

01:27:48.000 --> 01:27:53.360
when the child becomes sixteen years of age, treat him like a friend.

01:27:54.240 --> 01:27:59.360
Now, only eight years have passed in this country, and there are many

01:27:59.360 --> 01:28:02.729
whom I am treating just like a friend. I’ve never a problem with many.

01:28:02.729 --> 01:28:05.760
And all of you should be like that. But in the beginning, you do need

01:28:05.760 --> 01:28:09.920
disciplining, no doubt. That’s the only way you can drive out

01:28:09.920 --> 01:28:19.200
your bhoots, I tell you. It has to be forced.

01:28:19.200 --> 01:28:22.640
Of course, the time will come when it won’t be forced, you see.

01:28:22.640 --> 01:28:31.840
As I would say, first communism, then democracy. Otherwise, we’ll all

01:28:31.840 --> 01:28:39.036
go mad. If you give democracy, people don’t know how to use freedom.

01:28:39.036 --> 01:28:44.240
So, that’s important. Yes, please?

01:28:44.240 --> 01:28:47.600
Mother, how shall we bring up the children who are born to us,

01:28:47.600 --> 01:28:50.720
Sahaja Yogis?

01:28:50.720 --> 01:28:52.080
What?

01:28:52.080 --> 01:28:54.960
For example, should we get them to meditate in the morning?

01:28:54.960 --> 01:29:00.200
Should we force them to do it? Or shall we just let them…?

01:29:00.200 --> 01:29:01.480
What’s he saying?

01:29:01.480 --> 01:29:04.880
With regard with the practices within Sahaja Yoga, what should we

01:29:04.880 --> 01:29:09.520
as parents do for our children who are born of Sahaja Yogis?

01:29:09.520 --> 01:29:10.880
In practical way.

01:29:10.880 --> 01:29:12.480
They are born as Realized souls.

01:29:12.480 --> 01:29:14.480
Yes, Mother.

01:29:14.480 --> 01:29:17.600
You see, those are born as Realized souls,

01:29:18.320 --> 01:29:24.000
they have the awareness, no doubt, so they should be taught how to respect

01:29:24.000 --> 01:29:29.760
Sahaja Yoga, how to respect your Mother, how to dedicate.

01:29:29.760 --> 01:29:38.880
But you should not spoil them, because if they are Realized souls,

01:29:38.880 --> 01:29:42.880
they may try to get away with things which they should not be allowed.

01:29:42.880 --> 01:29:50.448
In the beginning, a Sahaja Yogi child has to be very well disciplined,

01:29:50.448 --> 01:29:53.520
it’s very important. It’s more important for a Sahaja Yogi child than for

01:29:53.520 --> 01:30:00.160
an ordinary child. Because he has powers. That’s how Ravana became Ravana.

01:30:00.160 --> 01:30:05.280
He was a Realized soul, but he was not trained to be a Realized soul,

01:30:05.280 --> 01:30:10.880
and he became Ravana. Because he was feeling as a unhuman being.

01:30:10.880 --> 01:30:14.640
So, you must train them up, you must discipline them in a way

01:30:14.640 --> 01:30:18.080
that is Sahaja Yogi’s style. It’s very important, it’s a very big

01:30:18.080 --> 01:30:25.280
responsibility. But respect them. And thirdly, I would say that always tell

01:30:25.280 --> 01:30:32.640
children what they are: “You are Sahaja Yogis. You have come on this earth

01:30:32.640 --> 01:30:44.320
for sacred work. You can’t behave like other children; you are the citizens

01:30:44.320 --> 01:30:53.040
of God’s kingdom. You are His children”. Remind them, put them up their ideals

01:30:53.040 --> 01:30:56.000
before them. “How can you behave? You are a Sahaja Yogi”.

01:30:56.000 --> 01:31:04.000
Mother, shall we also, for example meditation in the morning,

01:31:04.000 --> 01:31:07.520
shall we insist that they do it?

01:31:07.520 --> 01:31:08.480
Insist on?

01:31:08.480 --> 01:31:10.880
That they do meditation in the morning?

01:31:10.880 --> 01:31:14.640
Yes, yes. If you start doing it, they’ll do with you. But very important

01:31:14.640 --> 01:31:19.440
that, I’ve seen children in the West are very ego-oriented, even if they are

01:31:19.440 --> 01:31:24.240
Realized souls, still. You must have – I was telling Gavin – that you must give

01:31:24.240 --> 01:31:29.520
them a balance, put them “left to the right”. This country builds,

01:31:29.520 --> 01:31:35.120
you see, all the Western countries build this, what you call ego.

01:31:35.120 --> 01:31:41.680
So, best thing is to give them a balance, so that they don’t develop their egos.

01:31:41.680 --> 01:31:44.880
You can work everything on them. Very important there, you are

01:31:44.880 --> 01:31:49.120
their trustees. They are beautiful things,

01:31:49.120 --> 01:31:52.880
beautiful lamps, but you have to look after them, that no dirt should fall

01:31:52.880 --> 01:31:56.480
on them. They should not become dirty again, because I’ll have to cleanse them

01:31:56.480 --> 01:32:02.480
again and again, what’s the use? Discipline is very important,

01:32:02.480 --> 01:32:10.480
they’ll like it. Like my grand-daughters, I’ve seen, because my disciplining

01:32:10.480 --> 01:32:15.040
is rather subtler, but doesn’t matter. Even their own mothers,

01:32:15.040 --> 01:32:19.856
they would not go out without telling Me. Anywhere. Even if they have to go

01:32:19.856 --> 01:32:22.160
to their room, that is upwards, they will say to the mother,

01:32:22.160 --> 01:32:28.960
tell the mother, “I’m going up”. Of course, it’s family tradition

01:32:28.960 --> 01:32:32.480
and all that. And there are many people who come from families where there is

01:32:32.480 --> 01:32:34.960
no tradition like that. I find they behave

01:32:34.960 --> 01:32:38.867
in a very arbitrary manner. They might be born Realized,

01:32:38.867 --> 01:32:43.600
but what’s the use? And as Sahaja Yogis – it is your duty that you are parents –

01:32:43.600 --> 01:32:48.880
think that you’re starting a new dynasty now, and these are your children;

01:32:48.880 --> 01:32:56.720
and they have to be trained as people of a new dynasty.

01:32:56.720 --> 01:33:04.240
It doesn’t look nice for Realized souls to behave like very ordinary,

01:33:04.240 --> 01:33:08.640
mundane type of people. There should be a certain dignity, there should be

01:33:08.640 --> 01:33:17.760
certain understanding and the quarrelling and all this selfishness, really must

01:33:17.760 --> 01:33:23.840
go away from us. Materialism, materialistic attitude, every time

01:33:23.840 --> 01:33:27.600
you can imagine you are a Sahaja Yogi. Put their attention more

01:33:27.600 --> 01:33:32.080
to the vibrations side, more to the Realization side, asking them

01:33:32.080 --> 01:33:39.760
what is catching, where – they’ll change. You have to talk to – you have to talk

01:33:39.760 --> 01:33:44.960
to them. Moral ideals, about moral things,

01:33:44.960 --> 01:33:54.080
you have to talk to them. Your own behaviour should be ideal.

01:33:54.080 --> 01:34:01.840
But also, you have to talk to them and tell them that, “This is not good”.

01:34:01.840 --> 01:34:07.280
As it is, being Realized, they are very helpful, but I’d say, Kevin was

01:34:07.280 --> 01:34:11.040
a Realized soul, but in between he was influenced by the grand-mother,

01:34:11.040 --> 01:34:14.620
so there was a problem with him. But then he came round, isn’t it, Pat?

01:34:14.620 --> 01:34:14.640
So much changed now.

01:34:14.640 --> 01:34:19.240
Yes, Mother. He improved tremendously when we did start disciplining him.

01:34:19.240 --> 01:34:19.680
Hum?

01:34:19.680 --> 01:34:23.920
When he started coming every time to meditate with us in the morning,

01:34:23.920 --> 01:34:26.023
he improved a lot.

01:34:26.023 --> 01:34:27.230
You have to tell.

01:34:27.230 --> 01:34:31.680
Before that we were leaving him to see what would happen, but it didn’t work

01:34:31.680 --> 01:34:32.952
at all.

01:34:32.952 --> 01:34:36.320
No, no. That’s only here they do like this, I think, it’s avoiding

01:34:36.320 --> 01:34:41.600
the responsibility. In childhood, you must tell children what you want

01:34:41.600 --> 01:34:47.680
to say, what you want to do. They must be trained because, you see,

01:34:47.680 --> 01:34:52.160
after all, who is going to guide them? Guidance is very important,

01:34:52.160 --> 01:35:04.391
it’s not conditioning. I must say our children are very obedient

01:35:04.391 --> 01:35:07.709
in India whether they are Realized or not, aren’t they?

01:35:07.709 --> 01:35:08.713
Yes.

01:35:08.713 --> 01:35:14.240
If you tell them, “Sit”, they sit. And here, very ego-oriented.

01:35:14.240 --> 01:35:19.680
You can see the children how ego-oriented they are.

01:35:19.680 --> 01:35:25.040
And the Indian children have such a natural poise, a natural respect.

01:35:25.040 --> 01:35:30.385
Absolutely. We never feel them anywhere, you see? If you tell them, “Sit down”,

01:35:30.385 --> 01:35:32.636
they’ll sit. If you tell them, “I want this”, they’ll go and get it.

01:35:32.636 --> 01:35:36.020
You see now, just now, she brought the flowers with a friend,

01:35:36.020 --> 01:35:50.640
… touched my feet and now gone, finished. But our upbringing never ends, you see.

01:35:50.640 --> 01:35:53.920
Even when they’re grown up, we tell people, “This is not good,

01:35:53.920 --> 01:35:56.635
this should not be done”, and nobody feels bad about it, on the contrary

01:35:56.635 --> 01:36:01.360
they feel, “We have parents, thank God, somebody to tell us!”.

01:36:01.360 --> 01:36:05.280
But here the parents also have gone amuck, I must say.

01:36:05.280 --> 01:36:11.440
Because of this world war, maybe. Like Pat’s father used to drink

01:36:11.440 --> 01:36:17.520
and the mother said, “What’s wrong in drinking?”

01:36:17.520 --> 01:36:28.000
Like once, Sadhana asked Me that the –

01:36:28.000 --> 01:36:48.480
Thank you, thank you very much, thank you very much. Thank you.

01:36:48.480 --> 01:36:52.888
Good, “thik hai”… Really funny.

01:37:18.782 --> 01:37:21.040
The&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:37:21.040 --> 01:37:26.320
parents are funny, that’s why, there’s confusion.

01:37:26.320 --> 01:37:31.040
And that’s how the people don’t understand that we have more values, moral values

01:37:31.040 --> 01:37:34.560
than our parents have, then what to do? It’s all the war and all that,

01:37:34.560 --> 01:37:41.760
has upset them. But let’s re-establish a new dynasty as I said.

01:37:41.760 --> 01:37:44.560
Yes, please? Yes, Don?

01:37:44.560 --> 01:37:49.760
Mother, I’m asking this question on behalf of some of my friends.

01:37:50.560 --> 01:37:57.520
What hope is there for sahaja yogis who are married, whose partners

01:37:57.520 --> 01:38:00.045
are not seekers?

01:38:00.045 --> 01:38:01.360
Who are married…?

01:38:01.360 --> 01:38:13.032
But whose partners are not seekers.

01:38:13.032 --> 01:38:16.400
I mean, it’s the same lot – you see, your relationship with God

01:38:16.400 --> 01:38:21.360
is individualistic. It’s absolutely individualistic.

01:38:21.360 --> 01:38:27.040
Whether it is your partner, your father, mother, brother, son, everything –

01:38:27.040 --> 01:38:34.080
that’s not you. Your relationship with your God is absolutely

01:38:34.080 --> 01:38:38.960
individualistic. And because you are connected with God, you get collectively

01:38:38.960 --> 01:38:43.200
conscious, and that’s how they are all your relations.

01:38:43.200 --> 01:38:46.400
For a person like that, what is the future?

01:38:46.400 --> 01:38:49.600
They might get a realised soul, that’s all I can say.

01:38:49.600 --> 01:38:52.800
If the father is a realised soul and the mother is a realised soul.

01:38:52.800 --> 01:38:56.800
Definitely, I’m sure it will be a realised soul.

01:38:59.440 --> 01:39:04.080
Out of at least three children there could be one who is definitely

01:39:04.080 --> 01:39:12.320
a realised soul. Could be all of them. That’s the thing I can say.

01:39:12.320 --> 01:39:17.840
He’s been speaking of husband and wife, the case where a partner is disinterested

01:39:17.840 --> 01:39:23.680
and just not a seeker, that when the case when one person

01:39:23.680 --> 01:39:25.360
is very strong in his seeking.

01:39:28.240 --> 01:39:33.980
Let’s say the wife may not be interested in Sahaja Yoga, but the man is.

01:39:33.980 --> 01:39:43.200
Forget it. What can you do? (Shri Mataji laughs) Just forget it.

01:39:43.200 --> 01:39:47.680
I mean, Sahaja Yoga is something beyond, is something inner, isn’t it?

01:39:47.680 --> 01:39:50.960
You can have all kinds of relationship with anyone, your wife or anyone.

01:39:50.960 --> 01:39:54.155
If she is a sahaja yogini it will be of course much more enjoyable

01:39:54.155 --> 01:39:56.560
as a company. May not be so much enjoyable,

01:39:56.560 --> 01:39:58.760
but what to do? You have to live with so many things

01:39:58.760 --> 01:40:07.360
in this, isn’t it? Of course, as far as the born realised

01:40:07.360 --> 01:40:22.320
are concerned, that they will have. No doubt.

01:40:22.320 --> 01:40:31.040
What is the future of sahaja yogis, as it is?

01:40:31.040 --> 01:40:42.224
I mean, you have no future. You have no past, you have no future.

01:40:42.224 --> 01:40:50.800
You are eternal. What is the future of an eternal being?

01:40:50.800 --> 01:40:53.200
You have gone beyond these things. You are just there.

01:40:53.200 --> 01:40:59.600
Doing God’s works. Employed by God (laughter).

01:40:59.600 --> 01:41:03.840
All the unemployed are really there because they have to be employed by God!

01:41:03.840 --> 01:41:08.240
Haven’t you understood this point? (Laughter)

01:41:08.240 --> 01:41:14.800
The gentleman who interviewed Me on the television, no – on the radio,

01:41:14.800 --> 01:41:19.680
he was very angry with Mrs Thatcher and things like that.

01:41:19.680 --> 01:41:24.720
And he was saying that, “What’s going to happen now?

01:41:24.720 --> 01:41:28.400
Tell me, in Sahaja Yoga, how you are going to look after the unemployed?”.

01:41:28.400 --> 01:41:33.187
I said, “I can give them employment”. (Laughter)

01:41:33.187 --> 01:41:37.200
You’ve got the employment. Now forget this employment,

01:41:37.200 --> 01:41:41.600
they have been employed by human beings, now let God employ them.

01:41:41.600 --> 01:41:44.800
And they’ll have no time at all, even to think they’re unemployed

01:41:47.880 --> 01:41:53.520
(laughter). All right? This is what it is.

01:41:53.520 --> 01:42:00.800
So we solved unemployment problem.&nbsp;

01:42:12.960 --> 01:42:14.400
He was amazed.

01:42:14.400 --> 01:42:17.840
I told him that once you get your Realisation,

01:42:17.840 --> 01:42:22.240
you’ll get employment immediately.

01:42:22.240 --> 01:42:25.360
After all, all science, everything they have done,

01:42:25.360 --> 01:42:31.440
just to give us time. Time for what?

01:42:31.440 --> 01:42:39.360
Why this time has come to us? Just for meditation, for our ascent,

01:42:39.360 --> 01:42:45.111
for God’s employment. And he said, “Are you able to everyone?”.

01:42:45.111 --> 01:42:48.240
He said, “How can you give employment to everyone?”. I said, “To everyone!

01:42:48.240 --> 01:42:53.680
Anybody who comes to us, we give them employment” (laughter).

01:42:53.680 --> 01:42:56.080
Because according to him, money does not matter,

01:42:56.080 --> 01:43:01.040
people are not anxious to get money, but they feel very depressed

01:43:01.040 --> 01:43:03.693
because they have so much time, they don’t know what to do.

01:43:03.693 --> 01:43:07.520
(To a child: “Yes, thank you. You did it, thank you”.)

01:43:07.520 --> 01:43:11.680
I said, “They are very busy people. Sahaja yogis are busy, aren’t they?

01:43:11.680 --> 01:43:18.844
They have no time”. (To a child: “Thank you”.

01:43:18.844 --> 01:43:34.720
To another child: “All right, you sit. You make her to sit there.

01:43:34.720 --> 01:43:37.600
All right!”. Laughter)

01:43:37.600 --> 01:43:44.160
I think we have covered quite a lot of ground, about, of questioning.

01:43:44.160 --> 01:43:48.320
Also we can have the same repeat tomorrow some time.

01:43:48.320 --> 01:43:56.229
So think it over, if you are not in thoughtless awareness

01:43:56.229 --> 01:43:59.760
(laughter). I’m not sure of that, tonight.

01:43:59.760 --> 01:44:08.000
I would say that now for a while I’ll go, then we can have our dinner what time?

01:44:08.000 --> 01:44:08.720
Six thirty?

01:44:08.720 --> 01:44:10.310
First they’ll give it as six here.

01:44:10.310 --> 01:44:11.520
Six here. And second…?

01:44:11.520 --> 01:44:16.640
Twenty minutes later.

01:44:16.640 --> 01:44:21.760
All right, so about eight o’clock we’ll again meet, will that be all right?

01:44:21.760 --> 01:44:22.529
Yes, Mother.

01:44:22.529 --> 01:44:22.942
May God bless you.

01:44:22.942 --> 01:44:25.501
Thank you, Mother.

01:44:30.240 --> 01:44:33.240
May God bless you all.

01:46:01.171 --> 01:46:05.823
(After a long pause) Good. May God bless you.

01:46:23.268 --> 01:46:28.132
You are welcome. Where was Rustom? Now you can go in the kitchen,

01:46:42.028 --> 01:46:45.028
they should be quiet for a while. Receive it. Be quiet.

01:46:45.028 --> 01:46:53.575
You don’t have any problems. Now. Be quiet for a while,

01:46:53.575 --> 01:46:56.956
just enjoy it.

01:47:00.085 --> 01:47:03.358
(Shri Mataji stands up and leaves the hall. Sahaja yogis stand up)

01:47:03.358 --> 01:47:05.411
All right, sit down.
